1
00:00:01,710 --> 00:02:00,780
Visit our website for more: turkision.com

2
00:02:03,850 --> 00:02:08,320
No living being was harmed
during the filming of this series.

3
00:02:09,759 --> 00:02:11,860
Episode 113

4
00:02:12,330 --> 00:02:16,170
You love and adore.

5
00:02:17,110 --> 00:02:18,180
You excuse.

6
00:02:19,110 --> 00:02:22,420
You don't know what grief is.

7
00:02:23,390 --> 00:02:24,770
You excuse.

8
00:02:25,590 --> 00:02:28,700
I cried a thousand nights without you.

9
00:02:29,570 --> 00:02:33,510
You didn't deprive
yourself for one night.

10
00:02:33,950 --> 00:02:35,290
You're excused.

11
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:46,070
Ahmed Ghazali

12
00:02:48,270 --> 00:02:50,390
What a good thing he said, isn't it?

13
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:58,560
But what made him write these verses
was a great concern he lived.

14
00:03:00,970 --> 00:03:01,910
Love.

15
00:03:05,580 --> 00:03:07,670
Going through a love trouble...

16
00:03:08,810 --> 00:03:11,080
Especially when it is
love from both sides...

17
00:03:15,130 --> 00:03:18,760
No lover should be separated
from the one she loves...

18
00:03:19,060 --> 00:03:20,130
Alçiçek.

19
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:24,890
Love is the highest
feeling in this world.

20
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:30,880
Why did you summon me, Mother Sultan?

21
00:03:39,970 --> 00:03:44,770
It is necessary for
lovers to meet, Alçiçek.

22
00:03:50,090 --> 00:03:52,190
We separated you from the one you love.

23
00:03:55,170 --> 00:03:57,070
And we locked you in a cage.

24
00:04:05,170 --> 00:04:07,510
Let's see if you can forgive us.

25
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,560
Come on.

26
00:04:17,790 --> 00:04:22,260
Come on, move your wrists, not your mouth.

27
00:04:24,750 --> 00:04:25,980
Come on.

28
00:04:31,590 --> 00:04:33,520
It will be fine.

29
00:04:33,520 --> 00:04:35,750
I will make you hold the sword.

30
00:04:35,770 --> 00:04:40,120
So that Bala Hatun will include you among
the The Sisters, Ülgen sis...--

31
00:04:43,710 --> 00:04:45,080
Say, say it.

32
00:04:45,150 --> 00:04:46,200
Speak.

33
00:04:46,710 --> 00:04:49,640
I will take your soul with the sword.

34
00:04:50,750 --> 00:04:52,520
Oh my!

35
00:04:52,950 --> 00:04:56,490
Say one more word and I'll cut
that tongue out of your mouth.

36
00:04:56,820 --> 00:05:00,270
What do you do? We are training.

37
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:08,400
Isn't there a man in this large
tribe? Why does Osman Bey send you?

38
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:10,450
Also, why would I train myself?

39
00:05:11,780 --> 00:05:15,590
What does Cerkutay
understand from swords?

40
00:05:15,710 --> 00:05:17,210
Ask me about swords.

41
00:05:17,350 --> 00:05:20,230
You are correct, Gürbüz Alp.

42
00:05:21,070 --> 00:05:23,160
I don't understand what he does.

43
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:30,670
Osman Bey commanded me.

44
00:05:31,370 --> 00:05:34,190
A Bey's order can not be violated.

45
00:05:37,450 --> 00:05:38,520
Come on.

46
00:05:40,650 --> 00:05:42,620
Take your sword and stand before me.

47
00:05:46,350 --> 00:05:49,510
I told you, take your sword and
stand before me, Ülgen Hatun.

48
00:05:59,660 --> 00:06:01,040
Well.

49
00:06:05,870 --> 00:06:06,950
Attack.

50
00:06:19,670 --> 00:06:22,860
You will look into the
eyes of your enemy...

51
00:06:23,510 --> 00:06:25,460
without being afraid.

52
00:06:26,830 --> 00:06:28,630
You have to protect yourself.

53
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:37,470
It will make women forget what you know.

54
00:06:39,010 --> 00:06:41,700
Look at me, what am I saying.

55
00:06:42,610 --> 00:06:44,420
You will ask me about the sword.

56
00:06:51,590 --> 00:06:53,200
Why did you come?

57
00:06:53,330 --> 00:06:54,880
Osman Bey is waiting for you

58
00:06:54,970 --> 00:06:55,910
Come on.

59
00:06:56,310 --> 00:06:58,380
Are you saying this now? You...

60
00:06:58,410 --> 00:06:59,960
Practice!

61
00:07:00,030 --> 00:07:02,020
Come on, come on.

62
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:05,990
- Come on.
- Slow down.

63
00:07:06,630 --> 00:07:07,970
Quickly.

64
00:07:10,650 --> 00:07:11,660
Look at him.

65
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:14,160
He gets angry too.

66
00:07:19,290 --> 00:07:20,280
Alçiçek.

67
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:23,560
Loneliness is Allah's only.

68
00:07:25,790 --> 00:07:29,330
People should not be separated
from the one they love.

69
00:07:31,380 --> 00:07:34,580
Let your words match your
actions, Mother Sultan.

70
00:07:35,670 --> 00:07:38,590
What are you saying? You tried to
marry me to Bayındır Bey.

71
00:07:42,330 --> 00:07:44,930
Human beings make mistakes.

72
00:07:45,890 --> 00:07:47,580
I am also a human being, Alçiçek.

73
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,630
Of course I might be wrong.

74
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:52,340
And I got it wrong many times.

75
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:58,000
But I didn't know the bond between
you and Aktemur was so strong.

76
00:07:59,810 --> 00:08:01,170
If only I knew this...

77
00:08:01,620 --> 00:08:03,770
I'd not promise Bayındır.

78
00:08:05,630 --> 00:08:08,060
This is of no importance, Mother Sultan.

79
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:12,840
Our love was tested by your own fault.

80
00:08:14,310 --> 00:08:16,240
We failed that test.

81
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,110
Both me and Aktemur.

82
00:08:21,700 --> 00:08:23,240
It's over.

83
00:08:24,130 --> 00:08:25,950
There is no need to talk about it.

84
00:08:30,020 --> 00:08:32,558
It's not over, Alçiçek.

85
00:08:34,270 --> 00:08:36,789
We both know very well.

86
00:08:53,110 --> 00:08:55,860
I am the one who put
these birds in the cage.

87
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:59,280
I am the one who will free them.

88
00:09:23,290 --> 00:09:24,780
I will bring you together.

89
00:09:27,910 --> 00:09:29,120
And also...

90
00:09:31,260 --> 00:09:33,870
Aktemur escaping from the dungeon...

91
00:09:35,160 --> 00:09:37,820
Do you think I don't know it
was you who helped him?

92
00:09:39,940 --> 00:09:44,940
Have you risked all this for
a love that's gone, Alçiçek?

93
00:09:49,030 --> 00:09:51,150
Why do I ignore it?

94
00:09:57,030 --> 00:09:59,840
Because you are like my daughter.

95
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:04,920
Be happy, be happy.

96
00:10:06,950 --> 00:10:09,760
Your story that remained
incomplete because of me.

97
00:10:10,900 --> 00:10:12,710
May it be completed.

98
00:10:13,060 --> 00:10:15,520
This has become very
difficult, Mother Sultan.

99
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:17,370
I have the strength to do this.

100
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:20,320
You can go out now.

101
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:24,670
I shall command the preparations
for your wedding to begin.

102
00:10:59,380 --> 00:11:02,830
Alçiçek and Aktemur.

103
00:11:03,570 --> 00:11:07,620
You two need to get together.

104
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:11,160
You will be very happy.

105
00:11:18,460 --> 00:11:22,690
You will think you are free.

106
00:11:25,320 --> 00:11:29,880
You will always be at my command.

107
00:11:31,490 --> 00:11:32,960
Can I come in?

108
00:11:34,830 --> 00:11:35,850
Come in.

109
00:11:41,730 --> 00:11:45,110
- Mother Sultan.
- Bengi Hatun.

110
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:50,660
- We have news from Esma.
- What is it?

111
00:11:51,700 --> 00:11:53,380
We know where he is now.

112
00:12:01,190 --> 00:12:03,780
Since we have overcome all calamities...

113
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:09,000
We will continue the
conquests from where we left off.

114
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:13,510
The death of Kantakuzenos...

115
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:16,400
will strike terror among them now.

116
00:12:16,980 --> 00:12:18,930
They will be extra careful.

117
00:12:21,650 --> 00:12:24,120
You should know the
latest news from Köprühisar.

118
00:12:25,270 --> 00:12:26,480
It's time.

119
00:12:27,350 --> 00:12:31,880
Cerkutay, you'll sneak
in with Ülgen Hatun.

120
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:36,760
Let me go too, my Bey, I know Köprüisar.

121
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:40,440
Tell Cerkutay what you know.

122
00:12:43,300 --> 00:12:45,810
I need you, you'll be by my side.

123
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:49,140
Your command, my Bey.

124
00:12:49,730 --> 00:12:52,950
Inshallah, we will know
everything in detail.

125
00:13:14,870 --> 00:13:17,910
You should know the status of Köprühisar.

126
00:13:22,390 --> 00:13:26,500
Then, Inshallah, we will
send our army there.

127
00:13:26,560 --> 00:13:29,310
Inshallah.

128
00:13:30,370 --> 00:13:31,460
My sons.

129
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:34,770
And you go to Sultan Mesut.

130
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:37,460
He would write letters
to Beys for rebellion.

131
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:39,810
His messages should be ready now.

132
00:13:39,910 --> 00:13:42,460
You will take it and
distribute it to the Beys.

133
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:46,290
Take food to him and ask
him if he needs anything.

134
00:13:48,100 --> 00:13:50,500
Your command, my Bey.

135
00:13:51,700 --> 00:13:55,380
The situation is bad now, take a large
number of soldiers with you.

136
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:57,380
No.

137
00:13:58,320 --> 00:14:00,260
The soldiers they have are enough.

138
00:14:01,680 --> 00:14:03,800
They will manage on their own.

139
00:14:06,900 --> 00:14:09,330
If the road is rough, so are
we, Mother Bala.

140
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:12,310
We'll manage.

141
00:14:13,250 --> 00:14:14,310
Good.

142
00:14:20,660 --> 00:14:22,550
Come on, my sons.

143
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:37,730
We know where Mesut is.

144
00:14:38,130 --> 00:14:41,990
Take enough soldiers with you and go to the
place that Esma said about, and find Mesut.

145
00:14:42,020 --> 00:14:43,830
Your command, my Sultan, come on!

146
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:48,960
We'll go to the Kayı tribe, come on.

147
00:14:57,060 --> 00:15:00,500
My Bey, how long are we going to
keep Sultan Mesut with us?

148
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:03,220
Let those messages get answered first.

149
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:06,850
Let us know which Beys stand with us.

150
00:15:07,730 --> 00:15:09,460
We will act accordingly.

151
00:15:10,470 --> 00:15:14,870
We will, my Bey, but we are rebels.

152
00:15:15,280 --> 00:15:16,870
İsmihan will not let us rest.

153
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:19,810
We have no business with rest, Boran.

154
00:15:20,610 --> 00:15:23,600
Our path is always
fraught with difficulties.

155
00:15:26,160 --> 00:15:30,240
Konur, you will establish headquarters
in Kızılca region.

156
00:15:30,950 --> 00:15:36,930
But there'll be no siege weapons, you'll
only carry swords and do training.

157
00:15:37,110 --> 00:15:40,480
Everything will be ready to
open when the time comes

158
00:15:40,980 --> 00:15:41,990
Your command, my Bey.

159
00:15:43,990 --> 00:15:45,720
As for İsmihan...

160
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:47,720
İsmihan...

161
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:50,420
She knows we are in the tribe.

162
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:53,730
She clearly had another plan.

163
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:59,590
Otherwise, she would have attacked us
with her army and tried to arrest us.

164
00:15:59,730 --> 00:16:01,330
What is her plan, my Bey?

165
00:16:02,280 --> 00:16:04,660
She will soon come and knock on our door.

166
00:16:05,350 --> 00:16:07,910
We'll know when she comes.

167
00:16:13,400 --> 00:16:16,400
- Can I come in, my Bey?
- Come in, Ayaz

168
00:16:19,510 --> 00:16:20,420
Come.

169
00:16:21,090 --> 00:16:23,270
My Bey, Mother Sultan is coming.

170
00:16:30,790 --> 00:16:32,560
Let her come and see.

171
00:16:37,400 --> 00:16:38,480
Let her come.

172
00:16:46,290 --> 00:16:48,600
Sultan İsmihan is coming.

173
00:18:13,350 --> 00:18:14,480
Are you ready, brother?

174
00:18:14,690 --> 00:18:18,160
Always my brother, trust is more
important than our souls.

175
00:18:43,800 --> 00:18:46,140
We've found traces, from this direction.

176
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:48,070
Come on, let's hurry.

177
00:18:48,870 --> 00:18:50,520
Mesut must be here somewhere.

178
00:18:50,720 --> 00:18:53,650
We won't stop until we find them.

179
00:19:17,090 --> 00:19:19,490
The valiants of Osman Bey are
coming, Hadrat Sultan.

180
00:19:24,120 --> 00:19:25,380
They also bring food.

181
00:19:25,520 --> 00:19:26,790
Mashallah.

182
00:19:36,690 --> 00:19:39,520
- Salam Alaikum.
- Alaikum Salam.

183
00:19:40,210 --> 00:19:42,930
I hope you are well, Hadrat Sultan.

184
00:19:42,930 --> 00:19:44,020
Thank Allah.

185
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:48,710
I brought food for you.

186
00:19:49,560 --> 00:19:51,000
Hadrat Sultan Mesut.

187
00:19:51,650 --> 00:19:55,300
Osman Bey said you would give
us some kind of trust. (an item)

188
00:19:55,570 --> 00:19:59,380
True, letters will be sent to the
Beys, I have written them all.

189
00:20:00,950 --> 00:20:02,760
My Bey!

190
00:20:03,650 --> 00:20:06,290
My Bey, Mother Sultan's men are coming.

191
00:20:10,340 --> 00:20:12,160
What are we going to do, brother?

192
00:20:12,560 --> 00:20:13,750
I have a plan.

193
00:20:15,170 --> 00:20:16,500
We'll get through them.

194
00:20:17,860 --> 00:20:19,280
Listen to me carefully now.

195
00:20:28,050 --> 00:20:29,350
Put down the swords.

196
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:41,490
Alps!

197
00:20:46,290 --> 00:20:48,600
You also lower your swords.

198
00:20:59,090 --> 00:21:03,030
I did not come here to arrest
you or to fight you.

199
00:21:06,280 --> 00:21:09,670
So, tell me why you came here...

200
00:21:10,560 --> 00:21:11,840
Mother Sultan.

201
00:21:17,080 --> 00:21:19,870
Head of Kantakuzenos...

202
00:21:20,290 --> 00:21:24,690
Is it a gift or a
threat, Osman Bey?

203
00:21:25,300 --> 00:21:27,230
I came to ask
you about this.

204
00:21:30,310 --> 00:21:33,080
Let it be what you want it to be.

205
00:21:36,100 --> 00:21:38,910
If you are against me...

206
00:21:39,350 --> 00:21:42,090
it's a threat.

207
00:21:44,310 --> 00:21:46,400
But if you are not against me...

208
00:21:47,320 --> 00:21:49,430
Then, it is my gift to you.

209
00:21:54,040 --> 00:21:56,520
While we thought you escaped from court...

210
00:21:57,270 --> 00:22:02,020
Our ally wanted
to execute you.

211
00:22:05,030 --> 00:22:07,990
This makes him my enemy.

212
00:22:11,090 --> 00:22:13,180
He has found
what he deserves.

213
00:22:13,650 --> 00:22:17,190
And the enemy of my enemy is my friend.

214
00:22:21,110 --> 00:22:25,240
For this reason, it was a
beautiful gift, Osman Bey.

215
00:22:28,660 --> 00:22:31,030
But the nice thing...

216
00:22:31,460 --> 00:22:33,920
is that you escaped from
his hands in some way.

217
00:22:37,810 --> 00:22:40,690
This is a success worth appreciating.

218
00:22:47,320 --> 00:22:53,140
Receiving appreciation
from you is our last wish.

219
00:23:02,870 --> 00:23:05,650
Really, Osman Bey?

220
00:23:07,650 --> 00:23:10,420
The fact that my appreciation
is a great gain...

221
00:23:13,270 --> 00:23:16,770
and no matter how much
Bala Hatun refused our affection...

222
00:23:17,120 --> 00:23:21,530
The only thing I want is
Allah's favor, Mother Sultan.

223
00:23:23,070 --> 00:23:25,960
We never bring evil.

224
00:23:31,020 --> 00:23:35,370
And what next, Osman Bey? Shall we
talk like this in front of the door?

225
00:23:36,060 --> 00:23:38,750
If you don't tell us why you came...

226
00:23:40,180 --> 00:23:43,530
You have no place inside, Mother Sultan.

227
00:23:59,330 --> 00:24:04,900
All the mistakes I made
and the attempts of rebellion you made...

228
00:24:06,010 --> 00:24:10,820
and your rebellious
words and rude behavior...

229
00:24:15,530 --> 00:24:23,340
They were all overlooked by the
merciful Seljuk Sultan Alaeddin.

230
00:24:26,950 --> 00:24:29,380
You are innocent now, Osman Bey.

231
00:24:31,130 --> 00:24:34,240
Now there are some important
things we need to talk about.

232
00:24:41,920 --> 00:24:43,540
Let's talk privately if possible.

233
00:24:58,150 --> 00:25:02,640
Please, Mother Sultan.

234
00:25:39,790 --> 00:25:43,260
There is no importance to others, let
us pursue the Sultan.

235
00:26:13,610 --> 00:26:16,570
You can't escape anymore, Sultan Mesut.

236
00:26:17,350 --> 00:26:19,420
I'll take you to Mother Sultan.

237
00:26:24,090 --> 00:26:26,580
You should not be
deceived by what you see.

238
00:26:27,570 --> 00:26:29,040
You are...

239
00:26:40,860 --> 00:26:43,830
Do you think it is so easy, Avcı Bey?

240
00:26:46,280 --> 00:26:48,140
They will come secretly.

241
00:26:48,760 --> 00:26:53,060
First, we'll lure them into the woods and
then we'll shoot them with arrows.

242
00:26:55,740 --> 00:26:59,910
Kumral Abdal! Change your
clothes with the Sultan.

243
00:27:06,880 --> 00:27:10,480
Take this, Kumral Abdal.

244
00:27:11,470 --> 00:27:12,570
My Bey.

245
00:27:13,150 --> 00:27:15,600
Come on!
Change your clothes quickly.

246
00:27:26,220 --> 00:27:27,720
Hurry up.

247
00:27:32,280 --> 00:27:36,250
My brother! You will be next to
the warriors and Sultan Mesut.

248
00:27:36,860 --> 00:27:38,480
Your command, my brother.

249
00:27:42,180 --> 00:27:43,810
You little devil.

250
00:27:45,670 --> 00:27:48,060
You are playing with me, right?

251
00:27:56,070 --> 00:27:58,210
And you were fooled by this game, Avcı.

252
00:27:58,350 --> 00:28:02,340
Don't be so eager to take
your soul, so go your way.

253
00:28:02,610 --> 00:28:05,830
I will not go anywhere
without taking Sultan.

254
00:28:09,480 --> 00:28:10,870
Let's go.

255
00:28:11,670 --> 00:28:13,200
Orhan.

256
00:28:18,220 --> 00:28:23,040
Maintaining trust is what we inherited
from our ancestors, Sultan Mesut.

257
00:28:23,110 --> 00:28:27,490
Don't worry about my brother
and Kumral Abdal.

258
00:28:28,440 --> 00:28:30,830
They just do what needs to be done.

259
00:28:31,930 --> 00:28:35,510
And now we're going to take you to
a place to stay for a while.

260
00:28:36,270 --> 00:28:40,770
You both possess the beautiful qualities
of Osman Bey, Inshallah.

261
00:28:41,080 --> 00:28:43,470
Thank you, Sultan Mesut.

262
00:29:06,720 --> 00:29:09,340
I give you back what you lost.

263
00:29:18,260 --> 00:29:26,340
As you've read, Osman Bey, this is the
document with which I give you Yenişehir again.

264
00:29:27,810 --> 00:29:29,440
Mother Sultan.

265
00:29:34,610 --> 00:29:37,310
So, you're giving me Yenişehir again?

266
00:29:45,820 --> 00:29:47,250
Alps!

267
00:29:57,800 --> 00:29:59,860
Come here.

268
00:30:10,250 --> 00:30:11,720
This is Hasan Alp.

269
00:30:14,770 --> 00:30:16,690
The son of Abdurrahman Agha.

270
00:30:17,850 --> 00:30:21,530
Abdurrahman Agha is one of
the merchants of Yenişehir.

271
00:30:22,110 --> 00:30:23,900
He is a pottery dealer.

272
00:30:26,690 --> 00:30:28,780
And he has four sons.

273
00:30:29,740 --> 00:30:31,330
The eldest of them is Hğseyin.

274
00:30:33,060 --> 00:30:34,790
He is Hasan's older brother.

275
00:30:36,210 --> 00:30:38,030
He was among my Alps.

276
00:30:38,870 --> 00:30:41,610
He fell a martyr in my arms.

277
00:30:44,840 --> 00:30:46,600
The youngest daughter is Züleyha.

278
00:30:47,120 --> 00:30:49,980
She was fighting the
disease in Yenişehir.

279
00:30:51,140 --> 00:30:53,390
She got better, thank Allah.

280
00:30:57,980 --> 00:30:59,640
And so on...

281
00:31:01,070 --> 00:31:02,530
This is Kemal Alp.

282
00:31:03,680 --> 00:31:05,840
The son of Fatma Mother.

283
00:31:06,590 --> 00:31:09,240
Fatma Mother has five animals.

284
00:31:10,050 --> 00:31:11,730
She sells milk in Yenişehir.

285
00:31:12,270 --> 00:31:16,400
All her children and grandchildren
are Alps of Yenişehir.

286
00:31:20,390 --> 00:31:28,160
Fatma Mother lost her husband as a martyr
in the conquest of Kulucahisar Castle.

287
00:31:31,920 --> 00:31:36,030
She told me when the conquests stopped.

288
00:31:38,030 --> 00:31:40,580
"Why do you stop, Osman Bey?"

289
00:31:42,210 --> 00:31:44,310
"Why do you stop?"

290
00:31:47,070 --> 00:31:50,950
"Did I lose my husband as a martyr so that
you would stop your conquests?"

291
00:31:56,490 --> 00:32:00,310
Alps, you can come out now.

292
00:32:13,050 --> 00:32:14,760
What I will say is...

293
00:32:16,630 --> 00:32:22,200
You did not take Yenişehir from me.
So, you can't give it to me.

294
00:32:25,280 --> 00:32:28,190
The only thing you'll take is
the property.

295
00:32:30,420 --> 00:32:32,490
Not the hearts of my people.

296
00:32:47,010 --> 00:32:52,260
The only thing you'll need
is a dry handful of soil.

297
00:32:59,890 --> 00:33:04,170
Did we grow up
with what others gave us?

298
00:33:06,650 --> 00:33:11,240
We take what we want
when we want it.

299
00:33:15,880 --> 00:33:20,710
What we didn't lose... huh?

300
00:33:21,230 --> 00:33:22,460
No.

301
00:33:23,340 --> 00:33:25,020
No need for that.

302
00:33:33,860 --> 00:33:36,670
You refuse what
Mother Sultan gives you.

303
00:33:39,380 --> 00:33:43,220
This is not a rational
decision, Osman Bey.

304
00:33:45,370 --> 00:33:48,000
As much as there are people whose
hearts are with you...

305
00:33:48,010 --> 00:33:51,180
there are people whose
hearts aren't with you.

306
00:33:51,270 --> 00:33:55,740
There are people among your followers
who are tired of being dragged...

307
00:33:55,835 --> 00:33:58,685
into one adventure after another.

308
00:33:58,770 --> 00:34:02,039
There are those who are tired of losing
their families as martyrs...

309
00:34:02,049 --> 00:34:05,309
for the sake of your endless greed.

310
00:34:05,320 --> 00:34:07,340
Of course, there are people like that.

311
00:34:08,420 --> 00:34:12,900
And we will all end up in the dust, so
why all this trouble?

312
00:34:15,320 --> 00:34:18,630
Let there be those who do
not understand the purpose of this.

313
00:34:19,050 --> 00:34:22,649
There is no harm in not understanding
the purpose of this as well.

314
00:34:22,780 --> 00:34:28,120
But he who understands the purpose of
our case will surely tell you.

315
00:34:30,170 --> 00:34:35,420
Osman Bey, the Bey of the
rebellious border regions.

316
00:34:37,530 --> 00:34:39,909
So, you don't accept what I offer you.

317
00:34:41,900 --> 00:34:45,699
Will you continue your
calling with one tribe?

318
00:34:52,210 --> 00:34:54,940
Your roots are not here.

319
00:34:56,980 --> 00:34:59,240
You did not grow up
in this country.

320
00:35:00,960 --> 00:35:06,470
How long will you be able to withstand in
these limits after this tyranny?

321
00:35:06,870 --> 00:35:08,310
Until death.

322
00:35:11,170 --> 00:35:12,400
Borders belong to us.

323
00:35:13,400 --> 00:35:15,040
We will defend it together.

324
00:35:16,960 --> 00:35:19,170
That is why I have given you
your city back.

325
00:35:21,250 --> 00:35:22,290
You know better.

326
00:35:24,120 --> 00:35:25,800
The issue is getting bigger...

327
00:35:25,810 --> 00:35:26,870
Osman Bey.

328
00:35:27,840 --> 00:35:31,090
Tomorrow, the Beys of Germiyanids,
the Beys of Karasids...

329
00:35:31,510 --> 00:35:35,030
and the Beys of Isfendiyarids
will meet in court.

330
00:35:37,010 --> 00:35:38,550
And you too will come.

331
00:35:50,960 --> 00:35:53,380
I will answer the
invitation, Mother Sultan.

332
00:36:08,160 --> 00:36:10,260
I swear I'm starting to get scared.

333
00:36:10,300 --> 00:36:12,300
What is so secretive?

334
00:36:17,480 --> 00:36:18,910
This is it, Ülgen.

335
00:36:18,930 --> 00:36:20,500
Come on, put on this armor.

336
00:36:22,800 --> 00:36:24,000
I'm wearing it?

337
00:36:25,120 --> 00:36:25,700
Yes.

338
00:36:25,840 --> 00:36:28,230
No... What...

339
00:36:28,230 --> 00:36:29,720
How do I?
What?

340
00:36:30,320 --> 00:36:31,140
Oh.

341
00:36:32,010 --> 00:36:33,120
What's going on, girls?

342
00:36:33,130 --> 00:36:36,790
First the sword and
now this shield!

343
00:36:38,930 --> 00:36:40,840
Will I be the in The Sisters?

344
00:36:44,520 --> 00:36:46,100
No, Ülgen...

345
00:36:47,960 --> 00:36:49,650
You will do an important job.

346
00:36:50,210 --> 00:36:51,280
Job?

347
00:36:53,080 --> 00:36:54,400
What job is this?

348
00:36:54,400 --> 00:36:56,400
A very important job.

349
00:36:56,610 --> 00:36:58,100
Don't panic.

350
00:36:58,100 --> 00:37:01,560
What can I do with
İsmihan with a sword and a shield?

351
00:37:01,810 --> 00:37:03,080
İsmihan?

352
00:37:03,140 --> 00:37:04,770
No, I can't do it.

353
00:37:04,870 --> 00:37:06,730
She will devour me, she
will devour me raw.

354
00:37:06,760 --> 00:37:09,030
I can't do it. Many
soldiers have already come.

355
00:37:09,050 --> 00:37:11,300
No, Ülgen, it's not like that.

356
00:37:11,830 --> 00:37:12,530
What?

357
00:37:13,410 --> 00:37:14,310
Bengi Hatun.

358
00:37:14,310 --> 00:37:16,310
She is burying me alive, girl.

359
00:37:17,460 --> 00:37:18,960
Köprühisar, Ülgen.

360
00:37:18,960 --> 00:37:21,940
You will sneak into
Köprühisar and collect information.

361
00:37:26,710 --> 00:37:29,460
I thought you were going
to say something serious.

362
00:37:33,060 --> 00:37:34,170
What?

363
00:37:34,260 --> 00:37:35,000
What?

364
00:37:35,040 --> 00:37:37,040
Will I become a spy?

365
00:37:39,170 --> 00:37:40,050
Alone?

366
00:37:41,890 --> 00:37:42,950
In Köprühisar?

367
00:37:47,000 --> 00:37:48,390
Oh, Ülgen...

368
00:37:49,270 --> 00:37:52,850
It is written in your destiny to go to
the infidels alone on a mission.

369
00:37:55,360 --> 00:37:56,770
Forgive me.

370
00:37:58,000 --> 00:37:59,480
Ülgen, come on.

371
00:37:59,480 --> 00:38:01,480
Stop it, Ülgen, stop it.

372
00:38:01,730 --> 00:38:04,530
Is it possible that we throw
you into the flames alone?

373
00:38:05,040 --> 00:38:06,640
You won't go alone

374
00:38:06,640 --> 00:38:09,410
Osman Bey will give you a
distinguished road companion.

375
00:38:09,760 --> 00:38:10,730
Who?

376
00:38:11,840 --> 00:38:13,810
Cerkutay Alp will go with you.

377
00:38:17,910 --> 00:38:19,140
Cerkutay?

378
00:38:19,750 --> 00:38:22,450
He messes things up.
I'll go on my own.

379
00:38:25,880 --> 00:38:26,870
Okay, then.

380
00:38:28,320 --> 00:38:30,000
I'll tell Osman Bey...

381
00:38:30,520 --> 00:38:31,500
He might agree.

382
00:38:31,590 --> 00:38:32,810
Okay, no problem.

383
00:38:32,950 --> 00:38:34,380
Osman Bey ordered that.

384
00:38:34,470 --> 00:38:36,230
We cannot say more than he said.

385
00:38:36,230 --> 00:38:38,320
Well then. Let him come.

386
00:38:38,600 --> 00:38:40,600
He'll learn how to become a spy.

387
00:38:40,960 --> 00:38:42,530
Come on, Ülgen, come on.

388
00:38:42,530 --> 00:38:44,530
Come on, quickly put this on.

389
00:38:44,630 --> 00:38:45,590
Well.

390
00:38:46,420 --> 00:38:49,140
This is... the front end.

391
00:38:49,760 --> 00:38:50,690
Is that so?

392
00:38:51,280 --> 00:38:52,010
Ülgen.

393
00:38:52,040 --> 00:38:52,990
It doesn't fit.

394
00:38:53,060 --> 00:38:55,060
Not like that, Ülgen, not like that.

395
00:39:09,320 --> 00:39:10,760
What's the matter, Mother Sultan?

396
00:39:10,770 --> 00:39:12,210
You said it was very urgent.

397
00:39:12,210 --> 00:39:13,840
I don't know how you came.

398
00:39:13,840 --> 00:39:16,290
It's good, Bengi Hatun.

399
00:39:16,640 --> 00:39:18,640
I will give you an important job.

400
00:39:18,870 --> 00:39:19,960
Your command.

401
00:39:21,780 --> 00:39:22,930
From now on...

402
00:39:22,990 --> 00:39:25,540
The future of the Kayı
clan is in your hands.

403
00:39:25,650 --> 00:39:29,630
And how will this happen? I am
not related to the Kayı tribe.

404
00:39:30,630 --> 00:39:31,810
Yes...

405
00:39:32,760 --> 00:39:33,810
but you will be.

406
00:39:35,540 --> 00:39:37,620
You will let Aktemur and Alçiçek marry.

407
00:39:40,020 --> 00:39:41,330
Mother Sultan.

408
00:39:41,650 --> 00:39:43,130
This is not possible.

409
00:39:43,970 --> 00:39:45,630
Ask me what you want.

410
00:39:46,050 --> 00:39:47,960
Ask for my soul and
I'll give it to you.

411
00:39:48,000 --> 00:39:49,450
But this can not...

412
00:39:49,510 --> 00:39:50,530
I can not...--

413
00:39:50,560 --> 00:39:52,560
I said my word...

414
00:39:53,330 --> 00:39:54,560
Bengi Hatun.

415
00:39:56,960 --> 00:39:58,230
Use your mind.

416
00:40:00,020 --> 00:40:02,280
No matter how much we oppose it...

417
00:40:03,080 --> 00:40:05,560
We will not be able to
prevent it from happening.

418
00:40:06,070 --> 00:40:07,160
Mother Sultan.

419
00:40:07,940 --> 00:40:09,160
This can not...-

420
00:40:09,910 --> 00:40:12,100
If I make my daughter a
bride for the Kayıs...

421
00:40:12,310 --> 00:40:14,070
I will lose her forever.

422
00:40:14,100 --> 00:40:15,510
- This is...
- Bengi Hatun!

423
00:40:21,270 --> 00:40:24,120
She asks for reconciliation and peace.

424
00:40:26,130 --> 00:40:29,030
She also wanted to give you Yenişehir.

425
00:40:34,100 --> 00:40:36,340
What can she seek
from that move, my Bey?

426
00:40:42,000 --> 00:40:43,430
She got trapped.

427
00:40:47,490 --> 00:40:48,900
What pushed her to peace...

428
00:40:50,210 --> 00:40:52,370
is a problem that makes her need us.

429
00:40:53,970 --> 00:40:55,510
It is definitely a big problem.

430
00:40:57,280 --> 00:40:58,320
Maybe, my Bey.

431
00:40:59,140 --> 00:41:02,050
Perhaps she understood that things
couldn't be done with Öktem and Bayındır...

432
00:41:02,135 --> 00:41:04,675
so she wanted you by her side.

433
00:41:04,740 --> 00:41:07,140
She has already invited Beys.

434
00:41:07,570 --> 00:41:08,390
But...

435
00:41:08,980 --> 00:41:11,320
She is still trying to get
close to us though.

436
00:41:12,870 --> 00:41:14,610
Obviously there is something else.

437
00:41:16,690 --> 00:41:18,210
But what we know now...

438
00:41:20,260 --> 00:41:22,020
is that she needs us.

439
00:41:24,310 --> 00:41:26,020
So, what do we do, my Bey?

440
00:41:28,950 --> 00:41:30,760
Since she needs us...

441
00:41:32,400 --> 00:41:34,210
We'll get what we want then.

442
00:41:35,600 --> 00:41:37,240
And one of the things we want...

443
00:41:37,670 --> 00:41:39,670
is Köprühisar.

444
00:41:39,940 --> 00:41:41,750
The spy is ready, my Bey.

445
00:41:46,280 --> 00:41:48,580
To not to lose your daughter...

446
00:41:48,770 --> 00:41:50,340
You will accept this.

447
00:41:52,690 --> 00:41:54,740
Aktemur and Alçiçek will marry.

448
00:41:56,020 --> 00:41:57,250
Think for...

449
00:41:57,960 --> 00:41:59,030
tomorrow.

450
00:42:01,250 --> 00:42:04,710
When Osman came down
from his chair tomorrow...

451
00:42:06,050 --> 00:42:07,480
I will declare Aktemur Bey.

452
00:42:10,000 --> 00:42:12,290
And you will stand behind your son-in-law.

453
00:42:12,690 --> 00:42:14,580
And you will rule the Kayı tribe.

454
00:42:15,440 --> 00:42:17,990
Aktemur is not like his uncle Osman.

455
00:42:18,950 --> 00:42:20,230
He is softer.

456
00:42:21,010 --> 00:42:24,200
You can use him however you want.

457
00:42:27,350 --> 00:42:28,720
How will this happen?

458
00:42:30,390 --> 00:42:32,870
If I want it to happen, it will happen.

459
00:42:34,480 --> 00:42:37,730
Also, that young man loves
your daughter very much.

460
00:42:40,120 --> 00:42:45,120
And there is nothing easier than
controlling a young man in love...

461
00:42:45,640 --> 00:42:46,790
Bengi Hatun.

462
00:42:49,410 --> 00:42:51,440
Aktemur will become your son-in-law.

463
00:42:52,150 --> 00:42:55,480
And you will rule the entire Kayı.

464
00:42:57,810 --> 00:42:59,940
And when you rule Kayı...

465
00:43:02,370 --> 00:43:04,200
I will rule the borders.

466
00:43:11,000 --> 00:43:13,750
Söğüt

467
00:43:19,890 --> 00:43:21,620
Salam Alaikum.

468
00:43:21,970 --> 00:43:23,560
Alaikum Salam.

469
00:43:23,620 --> 00:43:26,180
Alaikum Salam.
You have increased our honor.

470
00:43:26,640 --> 00:43:28,580
Thank you.

471
00:43:29,890 --> 00:43:31,380
You summoned me, my Sheikh.

472
00:43:32,980 --> 00:43:34,800
Sit down, Osman Bey.

473
00:43:45,280 --> 00:43:48,000
It's been a long time
we haven't met to chat.

474
00:43:48,660 --> 00:43:51,600
Chatting with friends is important.

475
00:43:52,520 --> 00:43:54,210
It increases sincerity.

476
00:43:55,350 --> 00:43:56,420
I wanted to...

477
00:43:57,190 --> 00:43:58,710
get closer.

478
00:44:00,160 --> 00:44:01,330
Because...

479
00:44:02,230 --> 00:44:04,960
Devil does not stand still.

480
00:44:07,140 --> 00:44:09,040
When he finds a small crack...

481
00:44:09,760 --> 00:44:11,700
it slips off
it immediately.

482
00:44:15,120 --> 00:44:17,590
There is no crack (division)
between us, my Sheikh.

483
00:44:20,850 --> 00:44:23,800
We will not allow the Devil
to get between us.

484
00:44:24,340 --> 00:44:26,520
All our quarrels are over, Inshallah.

485
00:44:27,600 --> 00:44:29,190
Isn't it, Osman Bey?

486
00:44:30,020 --> 00:44:31,650
Of course, my Sheikh.

487
00:44:33,170 --> 00:44:34,630
The tongue speaks...

488
00:44:34,950 --> 00:44:36,100
and we hear.

489
00:44:36,470 --> 00:44:37,300
But..

490
00:44:38,470 --> 00:44:40,900
There is something that no one hears.

491
00:44:41,590 --> 00:44:42,820
The language of hearts.

492
00:44:47,030 --> 00:44:49,140
Is it saying the same thing?

493
00:44:50,080 --> 00:44:55,970
Can Satan
really not touch this brotherhood?

494
00:45:01,730 --> 00:45:04,450
I brought you word from
Commander Nayman, Mother Sultan.

495
00:45:05,080 --> 00:45:08,120
Commander Nayman has learned about
Samagar's death.

496
00:45:08,470 --> 00:45:10,320
So, he wants a big blood money...

497
00:45:10,760 --> 00:45:12,920
and he will increase taxes.

498
00:45:13,640 --> 00:45:14,920
Otherwise...

499
00:45:14,940 --> 00:45:16,940
Your lands will be stained with blood.

500
00:45:18,280 --> 00:45:20,210
How dare you, soldier!

501
00:45:21,060 --> 00:45:22,390
You provoke my sword.

502
00:45:23,000 --> 00:45:25,650
Know
whose presence you stand in!

503
00:45:27,410 --> 00:45:30,230
I don't have anything to do with Samagar.

504
00:45:30,690 --> 00:45:33,610
You have to make whoever knocked his
head off pay his blood money.

505
00:45:33,670 --> 00:45:35,670
Not just Osman.

506
00:45:36,180 --> 00:45:38,020
You will also pay the price.

507
00:45:38,180 --> 00:45:40,020
You will all pay the price.

508
00:45:40,020 --> 00:45:42,020
Samagar was in your protection.

509
00:45:42,320 --> 00:45:44,500
Take him out.

510
00:45:46,960 --> 00:45:49,340
If you don't listen to me now...

511
00:45:49,410 --> 00:45:51,410
The only thing you will hear...

512
00:45:51,410 --> 00:45:53,410
is the cries of your followers.

513
00:45:54,280 --> 00:45:55,680
I will hear you...

514
00:45:57,320 --> 00:45:58,440
but tomorrow.

515
00:45:59,320 --> 00:46:02,980
Osman and the rest of the
Beys will also be here.

516
00:46:03,650 --> 00:46:06,780
And you will say whatever
you want in front of them

517
00:46:06,850 --> 00:46:08,310
Get out of my here now.

518
00:46:08,310 --> 00:46:11,860
You will pay for this, you
will pay for this!

519
00:46:13,110 --> 00:46:15,120
You will pay the price!

520
00:46:20,130 --> 00:46:24,610
The ambassador will appear before me
tomorrow while the Beys are in the court.

521
00:46:25,170 --> 00:46:29,750
Don't screw this up as
you couldn't catch Mesut.

522
00:46:35,250 --> 00:46:40,600
What is the purpose of
this move, Mother Sultan?

523
00:46:42,250 --> 00:46:47,300
It is certain that Osman will not
accept Nayman's requests.

524
00:46:48,350 --> 00:46:54,070
All Beys will testify to his disobedience.

525
00:46:55,770 --> 00:47:00,920
Osman will remain alone in this war.

526
00:47:03,220 --> 00:47:08,500
You must be more knowledgeable
than me, Mother Sultan, but...

527
00:47:09,420 --> 00:47:11,050
You say Mongols...

528
00:47:12,770 --> 00:47:18,770
Do you think they will simply leave here after
everything's over and Osman is defeated?

529
00:47:22,000 --> 00:47:25,670
All of them will
struggle with this problem.

530
00:47:26,970 --> 00:47:33,170
And with each move, their
need for me will increase.

531
00:47:34,870 --> 00:47:40,770
As always, you made the right choice.

532
00:47:48,770 --> 00:47:52,600
Not so much, Bayındır Bey.

533
00:47:56,520 --> 00:48:01,550
I will have those Kayıs step by step.

534
00:48:05,320 --> 00:48:08,450
I will make Aktemur and Alçiçek marry...

535
00:48:09,020 --> 00:48:13,160
and make Aktemur the
head of the Kayı tribe.

536
00:48:21,050 --> 00:48:22,550
Tell me, Turgut Bey.

537
00:48:24,150 --> 00:48:28,800
Öktem Bey is currently
supporting İsmihan.

538
00:48:29,620 --> 00:48:32,550
Doesn't that ever bother you?

539
00:48:33,070 --> 00:48:34,200
My Sheikh...

540
00:48:34,550 --> 00:48:36,200
And what about you, Osman Bey?

541
00:48:37,150 --> 00:48:40,200
When İsmihan's enmity became clear...

542
00:48:40,420 --> 00:48:49,850
Didn't it occur to you to say, "Turgut Bey, see
with whom you have cooperated"?

543
00:48:50,400 --> 00:48:53,620
"Turns out I was right."

544
00:48:57,850 --> 00:49:01,100
Whoever says "I" is wrong.

545
00:49:01,170 --> 00:49:04,820
Traitors will always be alone.

546
00:49:05,620 --> 00:49:09,600
You can't be a friend until
your first word is "you".

547
00:49:11,120 --> 00:49:18,200
He who does not put his friend
above himself cannot be a true friend.

548
00:49:24,600 --> 00:49:27,570
There are many examples of
friendship among the Companions.

549
00:49:28,600 --> 00:49:32,500
But there is a specific incident.

550
00:49:32,920 --> 00:49:36,370
Even the infidels were amazed.

551
00:49:37,270 --> 00:49:38,950
What is it, my Sheikh?

552
00:49:38,950 --> 00:49:41,420
After the Hudaybiyah defeat...

553
00:49:42,400 --> 00:49:45,470
The infidels were so angry...

554
00:49:46,400 --> 00:49:49,370
and they did all forms of treachery.

555
00:49:50,780 --> 00:49:54,350
Zeyd and Hubeyb...

556
00:49:55,350 --> 00:49:57,750
fell into the hands of the infidels.

557
00:49:57,750 --> 00:49:59,750
And they took them to Mecca.

558
00:49:59,750 --> 00:50:03,250
And there, they sold them to the infidels.

559
00:50:04,150 --> 00:50:12,270
And when they took Zeyd to the side of
the Kaaba to kill him treacherously...

560
00:50:13,550 --> 00:50:18,860
Abu Sufyan approached
him and asked him.

561
00:50:18,950 --> 00:50:21,300
He told him, "Tell the truth."

562
00:50:22,070 --> 00:50:26,970
In return for making you
reunite with your family safely...

563
00:50:27,250 --> 00:50:38,350
"Wouldn't you have wanted Muhammad to be in your place and to be killed in your place now?"

564
00:50:41,800 --> 00:50:46,150
Zeyd turned to him and said, "Never."

565
00:50:48,420 --> 00:50:53,360
I don't even want him to get hurt...

566
00:50:53,390 --> 00:51:00,440
while I was sitting with
my family, let alone this.

567
00:51:06,650 --> 00:51:14,300
The infidels were very surprised by Zeyd's
attachment to the Messenger of Allah.

568
00:51:17,800 --> 00:51:21,670
And the Quraish leader admitted that...

569
00:51:23,900 --> 00:51:24,750
saying...

570
00:51:26,500 --> 00:51:36,520
“I have not seen anyone love someone as
the companions of Muhammad love Muhammad.”

571
00:51:38,070 --> 00:51:41,020
To care about your friend more than
yourself...

572
00:51:41,820 --> 00:51:49,070
We learn that from Muhammad
and the Companions.

573
00:51:53,200 --> 00:51:59,750
It is a heartbreak that
destroys the infidels.

574
00:52:00,150 --> 00:52:08,590
This is why friends should let nothing
come between them, not even themselves.

575
00:52:09,020 --> 00:52:15,450
So that Satan does not find an
opportunity to get between them.

576
00:52:15,900 --> 00:52:20,500
And only when this happens, we do
not give a chance to the infidels.

577
00:52:22,350 --> 00:52:29,370
It is enough to remember this.

578
00:52:33,370 --> 00:52:34,800
Alright, my Sheikh.

579
00:52:35,450 --> 00:52:36,670
Well.

580
00:52:36,970 --> 00:52:38,500
Alright, my Sheikh.

581
00:52:43,900 --> 00:52:45,150
Do you allow us to enter?

582
00:52:46,900 --> 00:52:50,070
Princes.

583
00:52:50,500 --> 00:52:52,070
Go ahead.

584
00:52:53,870 --> 00:52:55,350
Salam Alaikum.

585
00:52:55,350 --> 00:52:57,350
Alaikum Salam.

586
00:52:58,520 --> 00:52:59,970
My sons.

587
00:53:01,270 --> 00:53:04,470
Apparently, the job was done properly.

588
00:53:05,300 --> 00:53:08,750
Thank Allah, my Bey.

589
00:53:08,750 --> 00:53:10,750
Mashallah.

590
00:53:12,200 --> 00:53:13,770
İsmihan.

591
00:53:14,850 --> 00:53:16,850
She sentAvcı after us.

592
00:53:19,070 --> 00:53:21,100
But we beat them, my Bey.

593
00:53:25,600 --> 00:53:27,120
What about Sultan Mesut?

594
00:53:27,120 --> 00:53:28,600
He is in good hands.

595
00:53:28,600 --> 00:53:30,600
He is with Kumral Abdal.

596
00:53:31,000 --> 00:53:37,050
As you said, father, they constantly change
their place and leave no trace behind.

597
00:53:38,870 --> 00:53:42,280
On the one hand, İsmihan behaves
as if she is approaching us.

598
00:53:42,450 --> 00:53:45,170
On the one hand, she makes Avcı
follow Sultan Mesut.

599
00:53:45,190 --> 00:53:48,190
She doesn't stop, as if what she
did to me wasn't enough.

600
00:53:48,220 --> 00:53:50,400
She keeps playing.

601
00:53:50,400 --> 00:53:52,400
Let her play whatever she wants.

602
00:53:53,850 --> 00:53:56,500
We are the ones who will
make the real game.

603
00:54:01,150 --> 00:54:02,850
Thank you, sons.

604
00:54:03,820 --> 00:54:05,510
May Allah bless the brave.

605
00:54:05,570 --> 00:54:07,570
Mashallah.

606
00:54:16,070 --> 00:54:17,300
Hatun!

607
00:54:17,700 --> 00:54:20,250
Do you hear what
you say?

608
00:54:20,320 --> 00:54:21,850
Is this logical to you?

609
00:54:21,870 --> 00:54:22,570
Öktem Bey.

610
00:54:22,590 --> 00:54:25,850
My daughter once came back
through the door of that palace.

611
00:54:25,980 --> 00:54:27,980
I'll never allow
something like this again.

612
00:54:28,010 --> 00:54:29,720
Don't you hear me?

613
00:54:30,850 --> 00:54:32,600
Mother Sultan is right.

614
00:54:33,550 --> 00:54:38,750
As we can't stand up to them, then
we'll take advantage of this matter.

615
00:54:38,780 --> 00:54:40,370
I thought Aktemur
was a good man...

616
00:54:40,380 --> 00:54:43,500
until he let my daughter down.

617
00:54:45,450 --> 00:54:48,100
I no longer trust that young man.

618
00:54:58,100 --> 00:55:01,820
We'll forget what Aktemur did.

619
00:55:04,320 --> 00:55:07,950
Aktemur is a fine young
man, quiet and respectful.

620
00:55:09,150 --> 00:55:11,070
As his father, Gündüz Bey.

621
00:55:12,770 --> 00:55:18,560
What I mean is, if you make him love you
and respect you, he won't go against your word.

622
00:55:20,020 --> 00:55:22,860
He's not as greedy as Bayındır.

623
00:55:23,400 --> 00:55:26,820
It's true what you're saying, it's true.

624
00:55:29,420 --> 00:55:31,950
Aktemur is young.

625
00:55:35,620 --> 00:55:38,720
He's easily controlled.

626
00:55:42,020 --> 00:55:51,200
If the Mother Sultan does what she said
and put Aktemur on the throne...

627
00:55:54,950 --> 00:55:58,050
We will become the strongest
tribe in the borders.

628
00:56:03,070 --> 00:56:05,840
Our daughter does
not become our enemy.

629
00:56:05,880 --> 00:56:07,880
And she
marries the one she loves.

630
00:56:07,920 --> 00:56:09,410
And we are getting stronger.

631
00:56:09,420 --> 00:56:11,420
Yes.

632
00:56:12,470 --> 00:56:14,570
But, Bengi Hatun...

633
00:56:17,820 --> 00:56:21,370
I will not repeat that mistake.

634
00:56:23,520 --> 00:56:24,770
Know that.

635
00:56:27,170 --> 00:56:29,270
Alçiçek.

636
00:56:31,770 --> 00:56:33,120
Come here, my daughter.

637
00:56:33,120 --> 00:56:35,120
Come.

638
00:56:41,550 --> 00:56:43,200
Yes, father.

639
00:56:43,670 --> 00:56:45,220
Now, my daughter...

640
00:56:46,220 --> 00:56:47,720
I will ask you a question.

641
00:56:48,620 --> 00:56:52,020
But you will tell me the truth.

642
00:56:52,800 --> 00:56:54,120
Okay?

643
00:57:01,320 --> 00:57:11,350
Do you still want to marry Aktemur?

644
00:57:14,170 --> 00:57:15,450
Tell me.

645
00:57:22,220 --> 00:57:23,900
Yes.

646
00:57:24,920 --> 00:57:27,400
I will go tomorrow and talk to Ayşe Hatun.

647
00:57:31,870 --> 00:57:33,720
And we will solve
this matter.

648
00:57:38,450 --> 00:57:39,550
Good.

649
00:58:04,670 --> 00:58:07,020
Hadrat Mother Sultan.

650
00:58:07,620 --> 00:58:11,050
Beys' units entered Söğüt.

651
00:58:11,700 --> 00:58:14,650
Beys will come soon.

652
00:58:14,650 --> 00:58:17,590
Good.
Let them come.

653
00:58:17,600 --> 00:58:19,600
Hadrat Mother Sultan.

654
00:58:20,520 --> 00:58:23,630
If you'll excuse me, I'd
like to ask you a question.

655
00:58:23,820 --> 00:58:30,170
Did you summon the Beys just to
unite against the Mongols?

656
00:58:30,800 --> 00:58:36,370
Because I know you like to kill
two birds with one stone.

657
00:58:38,050 --> 00:58:40,300
You understand, Bayındır.

658
00:58:41,300 --> 00:58:44,450
Sometimes, you understand everything.

659
00:58:45,250 --> 00:58:50,250
Osman will not consider my words.

660
00:58:50,920 --> 00:58:53,100
He accuses me of arrogance.

661
00:58:53,870 --> 00:58:57,070
He sees that my words are meaningless.

662
00:58:57,500 --> 00:59:03,570
But the Beys' ability would give
him conclusive evidence.

663
00:59:10,270 --> 00:59:16,670
You'll show him that the state isn't left
for him and will make him feel small.

664
00:59:18,470 --> 00:59:21,220
It'll be like a slap, Bayındır.

665
00:59:22,100 --> 00:59:26,670
On the one hand, we will unite, and on
the one hand, we will crush Osman.

666
00:59:29,420 --> 00:59:32,570
You thought well, Mother Sultan.

667
00:59:32,970 --> 00:59:35,000
You thought well.

668
00:59:35,620 --> 00:59:39,220
Osman needs to face this fact.

669
00:59:42,270 --> 00:59:44,570
If you'll excuse me...

670
00:59:46,120 --> 00:59:48,720
I don't want to
participate in the court.

671
00:59:51,650 --> 00:59:52,520
What's the reason?

672
00:59:54,770 --> 01:00:01,200
Mother Sultan, as you know, a poor man
like me has no place in that court.

673
01:00:02,070 --> 01:00:08,770
The elephants will battle, let the little
weeds do their thing outside.

674
01:00:10,920 --> 01:00:12,400
As you like...

675
01:00:12,770 --> 01:00:14,400
Bayındır Bey.

676
01:00:19,070 --> 01:00:23,620
Bayındır won't sit still, he knows
what he's going to do.

677
01:00:41,030 --> 01:00:43,780
I have always opposed this, Ayşe Hatun.

678
01:00:44,800 --> 01:00:45,880
But...

679
01:00:48,120 --> 01:00:50,890
They said "Don't speak
words bigger than you."

680
01:00:53,020 --> 01:00:56,310
So?

681
01:00:58,830 --> 01:01:00,240
I made a mistake.

682
01:01:03,080 --> 01:01:05,210
But I got my mistake.

683
01:01:05,880 --> 01:01:09,750
You can't stand in front of love
even if you are a stone wall.

684
01:01:10,130 --> 01:01:15,060
Do you know how many people's hearts you
broke until you understood your mistake?

685
01:01:15,560 --> 01:01:16,740
I know for sure.

686
01:01:16,750 --> 01:01:18,000
I know, that's why I came.

687
01:01:18,020 --> 01:01:20,200
I want to make up for my mistake.

688
01:01:23,830 --> 01:01:25,560
And you should understand me.

689
01:01:27,400 --> 01:01:30,430
I did not suffer pain that
could be easily forgotten.

690
01:01:31,840 --> 01:01:33,980
What I want to say is...

691
01:01:34,860 --> 01:01:37,760
If your son still loves my daughter...

692
01:01:40,010 --> 01:01:41,740
Come and ask for her.

693
01:01:44,560 --> 01:01:45,940
It's up to you now.

694
01:02:03,280 --> 01:02:08,410
The court that İsmihan will hold is different
from the Beys' council that we hold.

695
01:02:08,750 --> 01:02:12,810
We are not her companions, but
we will be her guests.

696
01:02:13,520 --> 01:02:18,540
Know that this place will be
different from the field of war.

697
01:02:18,870 --> 01:02:20,820
But what you should know...

698
01:02:22,440 --> 01:02:26,590
it that it will be a war of words, not
a war of the wrist.

699
01:02:27,160 --> 01:02:31,560
So, all of you will control your anger.

700
01:02:32,980 --> 01:02:38,940
Yakup Bey, from Germiyanids, whose borders
extend from the east to the far west...

701
01:02:39,480 --> 01:02:41,840
and the owner
of the largest armies...

702
01:02:42,080 --> 01:02:43,720
will be there.

703
01:02:45,650 --> 01:02:50,900
Qarasi Bey, whose line extends
back to Danishmend Ghazi...

704
01:02:52,310 --> 01:02:54,650
and who is the
ruler of the seas in the West...

705
01:02:54,740 --> 01:02:57,390
will be there too.

706
01:03:00,610 --> 01:03:03,940
Şemseddin Yaman Jandar Bey, of the
Jandar tribe, the ruler of Eflani...

707
01:03:03,950 --> 01:03:06,810
who wants to include
Kütahya to his lands...

708
01:03:07,580 --> 01:03:13,130
will also be there.

709
01:03:14,170 --> 01:03:16,280
Everyone will talk.

710
01:03:17,420 --> 01:03:22,350
Even if they say something worth
cutting their tongue, my Bey...

711
01:03:22,900 --> 01:03:24,310
Shall we shut up?

712
01:03:26,280 --> 01:03:27,960
You will be silent, Boran.

713
01:03:28,170 --> 01:03:31,060
The smallest of them is
five times as many as us.

714
01:03:31,400 --> 01:03:34,910
With their warriors and their possessions.

715
01:03:35,330 --> 01:03:40,780
At the slightest mistake, we'll be like the
one who goes to the fire with the blower.

716
01:03:40,830 --> 01:03:43,570
Thank you, my Bey, as you command.

717
01:03:46,710 --> 01:03:49,930
They are bigger than us and they
outnumber us.

718
01:03:50,750 --> 01:03:52,480
They are stronger than us.

719
01:03:53,170 --> 01:03:56,220
However, Inshallah...

720
01:03:57,520 --> 01:03:59,260
We equalize them in strength.

721
01:03:59,500 --> 01:04:01,350
Eyvallah, my Bey!

722
01:04:02,610 --> 01:04:06,830
If Allah allows, we will take what
we want and get out of there!

723
01:04:06,830 --> 01:04:08,830
- God willing, sir - God willing

724
01:04:10,730 --> 01:04:11,780
Come on, apls.

725
01:04:13,440 --> 01:04:14,740
Let's go.

726
01:04:26,020 --> 01:04:27,070
Let's go

727
01:04:36,240 --> 01:04:39,540
Are you scared, Ulgen Hatun!?

728
01:04:39,730 --> 01:04:41,370
Hatun-tun!

729
01:04:42,140 --> 01:04:43,000
Tun.

730
01:04:43,150 --> 01:04:44,540
Why would I be scared?

731
01:04:45,500 --> 01:04:48,070
I am the daughter of the black angel.

732
01:04:48,170 --> 01:04:49,240
Oh.

733
01:04:49,240 --> 01:04:50,740
I fear the fear.

734
01:04:51,220 --> 01:04:52,490
Just care yourself.

735
01:04:53,040 --> 01:04:55,570
Me?

736
01:04:55,870 --> 01:04:58,950
I was born to fear, to fear!

737
01:04:59,080 --> 01:05:02,100
Yes, you were. You are never scared(!)

738
01:05:02,640 --> 01:05:04,810
Hatun! Allah Allah!
Of course I'm never scared.

739
01:05:04,810 --> 01:05:07,260
When did you see me scared?

740
01:05:11,120 --> 01:05:12,630
Well, I'm not going to lie.

741
01:05:12,630 --> 01:05:13,900
I never saw you scared.

742
01:05:14,450 --> 01:05:15,540
But I know it!

743
01:05:16,310 --> 01:05:19,370
You're a coward, Cerkutay Alp.

744
01:05:20,780 --> 01:05:23,150
You are not afraid of the enemy.
However...

745
01:05:23,700 --> 01:05:26,490
You are scared of the person
riding next to you right now.

746
01:05:33,010 --> 01:05:34,380
It's true.

747
01:05:40,380 --> 01:05:43,240
Who is not scared of their heart!

748
01:05:43,410 --> 01:05:44,820
Wait for me!

749
01:05:45,890 --> 01:05:47,060
Wait!

750
01:06:11,010 --> 01:06:15,010
Why did Bengi Hatun come?

751
01:06:19,040 --> 01:06:21,410
Does she know we got Alcicek
out of the dungeon?

752
01:06:21,580 --> 01:06:23,590
It's none of your business why she came.

753
01:06:25,360 --> 01:06:27,470
Didn't you give up on Alcicek?

754
01:06:30,460 --> 01:06:31,480
Indeed.

755
01:06:32,720 --> 01:06:33,930
Yes, but...

756
01:06:36,210 --> 01:06:38,910
If she learned that,
she will disturb her.

757
01:06:38,910 --> 01:06:40,330
Of course she will.

758
01:06:41,590 --> 01:06:45,150
What's more, she might have even locked
the girl inside a room.

759
01:06:48,600 --> 01:06:49,590
She learned, right?

760
01:06:53,940 --> 01:06:55,000
What shall we do?

761
01:06:58,020 --> 01:06:59,530
How will we save Alcicek?

762
01:07:01,770 --> 01:07:03,060
Aktemur!

763
01:07:04,310 --> 01:07:06,900
You still love this girl!

764
01:07:11,180 --> 01:07:13,560
And you regret that you rejected her,
don't you?

765
01:07:14,300 --> 01:07:15,960
It doesn't matter now, mother.

766
01:07:16,430 --> 01:07:20,360
Tell me!
Do you regret or not?

767
01:07:34,740 --> 01:07:36,000
That day...

768
01:07:37,670 --> 01:07:40,330
I was at the face of death

769
01:07:46,740 --> 01:07:49,090
I closed my eyes and turned to the Creator.

770
01:07:55,100 --> 01:07:56,640
But at that exact moment...

771
01:07:58,530 --> 01:07:59,950
I had a thought.

772
01:08:01,070 --> 01:08:03,110
I left Alcicek behind, whom I misjudged.

773
01:08:05,070 --> 01:08:08,570
I broke her heart.

774
01:08:14,420 --> 01:08:15,800
I regret.

775
01:08:17,270 --> 01:08:18,569
Okay then.

776
01:08:19,950 --> 01:08:23,680
Go make it up to her.
We'll ask her for marriage this evening.

777
01:08:38,760 --> 01:08:41,630
Sogut

778
01:08:45,149 --> 01:08:52,620
Welcome Osman Bey!

779
01:08:54,399 --> 01:08:55,620
Come on!

780
01:09:20,020 --> 01:09:24,350
Osman Bey, you will enter the court of
the great Beys of the Attic Seljuk state.

781
01:09:24,700 --> 01:09:26,300
We have known you for a long time

782
01:09:26,569 --> 01:09:30,040
Please hand over your swords.

783
01:09:31,779 --> 01:09:33,050
Son.

784
01:09:34,529 --> 01:09:36,899
You just told me you've known me
for a long time.

785
01:09:37,029 --> 01:09:40,670
Then you should also known that
I always carry my sword with me.

786
01:09:42,790 --> 01:09:46,620
Yet you still try to be nice.

787
01:09:47,149 --> 01:09:48,250
Thank you.

788
01:09:48,630 --> 01:09:51,160
Cut this nonsense, Osman Bey!

789
01:09:51,960 --> 01:09:54,970
When the state orders you to hand them over,
you hand them over!

790
01:10:01,200 --> 01:10:03,520
You see my sword is in its scabbard.

791
01:10:04,140 --> 01:10:07,270
If you ever see it out of the scabbard...

792
01:10:07,430 --> 01:10:10,030
It will be the last thing you see.

793
01:10:16,480 --> 01:10:18,350
You tried to take it from me.

794
01:10:20,000 --> 01:10:22,480
You can't do it unless you die.

795
01:10:26,750 --> 01:10:28,290
Soldiers!

796
01:10:35,930 --> 01:10:37,130
Alps!

797
01:10:39,660 --> 01:10:42,510
Hand over your swords,
no blood will be spilled today

798
01:10:53,260 --> 01:10:54,680
Put down your swords.

799
01:11:03,580 --> 01:11:04,620
Baysungur!

800
01:11:05,060 --> 01:11:06,240
My Bey.

801
01:11:47,410 --> 01:11:49,010
Peace be upon you.

802
01:11:49,850 --> 01:11:51,780
And may peace be upon you too.

803
01:12:01,330 --> 01:12:04,030
Attention, Hadrat Mother Sultan!

804
01:12:26,290 --> 01:12:28,440
Where are the Beys, Mother Sultan?

805
01:12:28,810 --> 01:12:31,000
They are coming from a long way.

806
01:12:32,090 --> 01:12:34,410
They are coming with a big convoy.

807
01:12:35,150 --> 01:12:40,260
I appreciate them.
They are kind to come, Osman Bey.

808
01:12:42,410 --> 01:12:43,860
Welcome.

809
01:12:59,950 --> 01:13:00,980
Welcome my Bey.

810
01:13:00,980 --> 01:13:02,130
Welcome!

811
01:13:02,130 --> 01:13:10,000
The Bey of Candarogullari
Semseddin Yaman Candar Bey

812
01:13:29,330 --> 01:13:32,880
Welcome, my Bey!

813
01:13:33,060 --> 01:13:38,070
Welcome, my Bey!

814
01:13:59,640 --> 01:14:03,560
The Bey of Karesiogullari
Kalemsahoglu Karesi Bey

815
01:14:09,910 --> 01:14:13,400
Welcome, my Bey!

816
01:14:26,680 --> 01:14:32,010
Welcome, Karasi Bey.

817
01:15:05,900 --> 01:15:10,920
The Bey of Germiyanogullari
Yakup Bey

818
01:15:11,950 --> 01:15:13,960
Welcome my Bey!

819
01:15:48,820 --> 01:15:50,780
Allah bless you my Bey!

820
01:16:37,510 --> 01:16:39,670
The Bey of Candarogullari

821
01:16:39,670 --> 01:16:43,240
The owner of far lands
The ruler of the rural areas...

822
01:16:43,620 --> 01:16:45,710
Semseddin Yaman Candar Bey.

823
01:16:54,290 --> 01:16:55,380
Peace be upon you.

824
01:16:56,080 --> 01:16:57,120
Peace be upon you too.

825
01:16:57,250 --> 01:16:58,820
Peace be upon you too.

826
01:16:59,990 --> 01:17:01,520
Welcome, Candar Bey.

827
01:17:03,030 --> 01:17:06,950
I brought many presents, Mother Sultan.

828
01:17:11,010 --> 01:17:17,720
Here are our crops that we trade from north to south
and from land to sea in the four corners of the world

829
01:17:18,670 --> 01:17:20,940
All of them are the best.

830
01:17:22,340 --> 01:17:25,420
Perhaps even your palace hasn't tasted
this quality.

831
01:17:25,830 --> 01:17:26,820
Thank you.

832
01:17:41,550 --> 01:17:43,170
The nightmare of Byzantine.

833
01:17:43,500 --> 01:17:46,160
Who extended his control
from Edremit to Bandirma

834
01:17:46,440 --> 01:17:49,860
The killer of the infidels, Karasi Bey!

835
01:17:55,510 --> 01:17:56,950
Peace be upon you.

836
01:17:57,600 --> 01:17:59,420
Peace be upon you too.

837
01:18:02,160 --> 01:18:03,540
Welcome, Karasi Bey.

838
01:18:04,020 --> 01:18:06,210
Thank you, Mother Sultan.

839
01:18:07,030 --> 01:18:09,250
We have come in response to your invitation.

840
01:18:29,590 --> 01:18:37,070
This is the sword my father Kalem Shah
slayed the infidels with, in the conquest of Biga.

841
01:19:02,950 --> 01:19:04,870
My daughter's husband, Uslu Bey.

842
01:19:05,660 --> 01:19:08,850
He is as valuable as
the sword we gifted.

843
01:19:19,350 --> 01:19:21,280
Thank you, Karasi Bey.

844
01:19:26,410 --> 01:19:28,880
Governor of the region from Angro to Kutahya

845
01:19:29,040 --> 01:19:33,540
The owner of the strongest
tribes and the strongest armies

846
01:19:33,810 --> 01:19:37,010
The protector of the Germiyanogullari,
Yakup Bey.

847
01:19:44,580 --> 01:19:45,820
Peace be upon you.

848
01:19:46,190 --> 01:19:48,670
Peace be upon you too.

849
01:19:49,470 --> 01:19:50,670
Peace be upon you too.

850
01:19:51,420 --> 01:19:52,400
What is this?

851
01:19:53,160 --> 01:19:57,020
Are you greeting us with your sword
in your hands, Mother Sultan?

852
01:19:58,560 --> 01:20:00,200
Welcome, Yakup Bey.

853
01:20:18,780 --> 01:20:20,630
We heard your name, Osman Bey.

854
01:20:23,180 --> 01:20:25,180
Finally here we are meeting.

855
01:20:25,460 --> 01:20:28,160
Everything is waiting for its time,
Yakup Bey.

856
01:20:29,150 --> 01:20:31,570
No, not for its time.

857
01:20:32,740 --> 01:20:35,090
Everything is waiting for you to
stand still.

858
01:20:37,520 --> 01:20:39,710
We hear you in Constantinople.

859
01:20:40,640 --> 01:20:42,110
Then we hear you are in Konya.

860
01:20:47,270 --> 01:20:49,900
He who wanders a lot gets
himself into many misfortunes

861
01:20:49,970 --> 01:20:52,350
We are the sons of a traveling generation.

862
01:20:53,700 --> 01:20:55,420
Standing still is not for us.

863
01:20:56,590 --> 01:20:59,110
We love to visit the trouble.

864
01:21:00,110 --> 01:21:02,080
So that it doesn't come to our land.

865
01:21:16,550 --> 01:21:18,450
I love nomads very much.

866
01:21:19,760 --> 01:21:23,160
I always give them lands.

867
01:21:24,200 --> 01:21:29,990
But if you are a nomad,
you should know your place.

868
01:21:37,000 --> 01:21:43,060
And you have to learn to leave that dream
to those who deserve to dream it,

869
01:21:43,510 --> 01:21:46,910
to those whose lineage extends back to the state

870
01:21:54,500 --> 01:21:57,180
Everyone brought their gifts, Yakup Bey.

871
01:21:57,440 --> 01:21:59,080
Did you bring nothing?

872
01:22:02,300 --> 01:22:05,870
My gift is not small enough to be carried.

873
01:22:07,950 --> 01:22:09,580
Your gift is outside Sogut.

874
01:22:10,120 --> 01:22:14,390
Three hundred horses,
each one more powerful than the other

875
01:22:17,220 --> 01:22:19,260
Thank you, Yakup Bey.

876
01:22:27,780 --> 01:22:29,250
Go ahead.

877
01:22:50,700 --> 01:22:51,740
Osman Bey.

878
01:22:55,490 --> 01:22:56,300
Please.

879
01:23:13,200 --> 01:23:18,380
Why are our Beys not sitting, Mother Sultan?

880
01:23:27,180 --> 01:23:29,470
They stand in the place
they deserve, Osman Bey.

881
01:23:32,020 --> 01:23:38,680
You should be thankful to Mother Sultan
as she lets you sit with such Beys.

882
01:23:45,200 --> 01:23:50,750
We are not that kind of people who are grateful to
a human being as they have given us credit, Candar Bey.

883
01:23:52,910 --> 01:23:57,480
We get our possessions and our lands
with our own power.

884
01:23:59,650 --> 01:24:01,740
Don't confuse us with you.

885
01:24:08,300 --> 01:24:09,220
Beys.

886
01:24:10,770 --> 01:24:12,710
Sit behind me.

887
01:24:23,410 --> 01:24:24,990
Please, of course.

888
01:24:26,020 --> 01:24:29,200
They must be weakened after all
the long way.

889
01:24:34,600 --> 01:24:37,120
We can hear Mother Sultan now.

890
01:24:39,760 --> 01:24:42,220
The situation is worse than you think.

891
01:24:43,670 --> 01:24:45,750
There's news from Commander Nayman.

892
01:24:47,630 --> 01:24:52,950
The beheading of his commander, Samagar,
angered him greatly.

893
01:24:57,390 --> 01:24:59,060
He asks us to give more taxes.

894
01:25:01,510 --> 01:25:05,180
And to pay blood money for the head of Samagar.

895
01:25:05,660 --> 01:25:07,030
Mother Sultan!

896
01:25:09,030 --> 01:25:13,430
We are here to listen to you about
the part that concerns us.

897
01:25:14,360 --> 01:25:18,080
The one who caused this shall
pay the price himself alone.

898
01:25:20,820 --> 01:25:22,580
Who killed Samagar?

899
01:25:24,940 --> 01:25:25,890
Karasi Bey.

900
01:25:28,370 --> 01:25:30,110
Suppose I killed him

901
01:25:35,260 --> 01:25:37,310
Do not look at Osman Bey like that.

902
01:25:38,710 --> 01:25:42,120
Since when killing the enemy
has been a bad thing?

903
01:25:48,660 --> 01:25:52,660
I called you for unity.

904
01:25:54,380 --> 01:25:55,340
Mother Sultan.

905
01:25:56,690 --> 01:25:59,170
Where do you get your strength from?

906
01:26:01,660 --> 01:26:04,530
What kind of question is that, Yakup Bey?

907
01:26:04,740 --> 01:26:11,520
You get it from your son, the ruler of the
Attic Seljuk Empire, Sultan Alaeddin

908
01:26:14,560 --> 01:26:21,830
Will we unite with this Bey who wanted to
dethrone our Sultan and tried to kidnap Masut?

909
01:26:24,940 --> 01:26:28,230
Forget about us.
How did you forgive him?

910
01:26:29,310 --> 01:26:30,830
Only the helpless hold a grudge.

911
01:26:32,540 --> 01:26:35,800
Only the weak get angry.

912
01:26:37,310 --> 01:26:40,300
While the strong forgive.

913
01:26:40,950 --> 01:26:44,670
His Holiness Sultan Alaeddin forgave Osman Bey.

914
01:26:47,990 --> 01:26:50,320
If we accept this and want unity

915
01:26:51,360 --> 01:26:53,390
You also should do the same, Yakup Bey.

916
01:26:59,840 --> 01:27:03,900
The war with the infidels exhausted my armies.

917
01:27:06,740 --> 01:27:09,810
But wars bring trophies.

918
01:27:11,520 --> 01:27:19,180
I suggest paying the taxes and accepting
thedemanded blood money.

919
01:27:25,600 --> 01:27:28,610
And I am doing this only for you,
Mother Sultan.

920
01:27:29,560 --> 01:27:32,440
Otherwise nor Osman Bey...

921
01:27:32,930 --> 01:27:39,330
Nor these lands are worthy of
any tax or gold.

922
01:27:41,400 --> 01:27:44,110
If gold holds the Turks' land...

923
01:27:46,900 --> 01:27:49,090
Let it be burned down!

924
01:27:54,210 --> 01:27:59,240
The freedom that is bought with money
is lost when the money is gone.

925
01:28:01,960 --> 01:28:06,510
If we owe our lives to gold,
let it be redeemed.

926
01:28:09,910 --> 01:28:10,760
Osman Bey.

927
01:28:12,350 --> 01:28:13,650
Calm down a bit.

928
01:28:15,650 --> 01:28:18,340
Nobody has the intention of
losing their freedom.

929
01:28:19,740 --> 01:28:23,060
If we need to give blood money, we will.
If we need to fight, we fight.

930
01:28:24,200 --> 01:28:27,810
We are here for unity and to
search for a solution

931
01:28:28,540 --> 01:28:30,620
The solution to this is not blood money,
Mother Sultan.

932
01:28:32,820 --> 01:28:35,030
I took these areas with my own blood.

933
01:28:35,840 --> 01:28:37,420
And I built it with my blood

934
01:28:39,700 --> 01:28:45,540
Not blood money, but I won't even give
my dog for Samagar's head.

935
01:28:46,840 --> 01:28:48,480
You heard me.

936
01:28:59,430 --> 01:29:02,230
Emperor's Palace
Constantinie.

937
01:29:16,080 --> 01:29:18,210
Emperor Andranikos.

938
01:29:26,130 --> 01:29:29,710
The ring of Kantakouzanos
whom you serve came faster than you, Olof.

939
01:29:32,090 --> 01:29:36,910
I am only in the service
of Holy Jesus, Emperor.

940
01:29:38,140 --> 01:29:41,060
If our path unites, I'll be in your service too.

941
01:29:41,170 --> 01:29:43,900
Kantakouzanos got the end he deserved, Olof.

942
01:29:44,940 --> 01:29:46,480
If I didn't believe you...

943
01:29:47,290 --> 01:29:49,000
...I would bury you next to him.

944
01:29:50,250 --> 01:29:52,950
And now I will resurrect
the things he demolished

945
01:29:54,730 --> 01:29:55,910
The cross on your neck.

946
01:29:58,530 --> 01:30:00,100
I had heard that you became a Christian.

947
01:30:01,060 --> 01:30:02,640
But this was hard to believe.

948
01:30:03,760 --> 01:30:05,820
What you heard is correct, Emperor.

949
01:30:07,100 --> 01:30:09,140
I have chosen the religion of Holy Jesus.

950
01:30:10,500 --> 01:30:13,050
I am shedding blood for one goal only.

951
01:30:14,360 --> 01:30:21,360
And I will continue to spill it until
we expel all Muslims from our lands

952
01:30:24,560 --> 01:30:25,810
Marcus.

953
01:30:34,470 --> 01:30:35,560
I know that.

954
01:30:36,810 --> 01:30:38,250
That is why I summoned you.

955
01:30:41,670 --> 01:30:44,380
With what power, Osman Bey?
How will you fight?

956
01:30:45,280 --> 01:30:47,100
Who got in our way like mountains...

957
01:30:48,360 --> 01:30:50,850
...were crushed by us before.

958
01:30:55,250 --> 01:30:56,600
Let them come.

959
01:30:57,920 --> 01:31:02,120
If they come, they will go as they came.

960
01:31:05,280 --> 01:31:06,410
Osman Bey!

961
01:31:08,640 --> 01:31:09,730
Osman Bey!

962
01:31:11,130 --> 01:31:14,730
While your hundred tent tribe
was looking for land to settle

963
01:31:15,860 --> 01:31:17,770
We were crushing the Mongols.

964
01:31:20,460 --> 01:31:21,970
You don't even have a history!

965
01:31:23,040 --> 01:31:24,990
And who is the oldest Ghazi in your family?

966
01:31:25,610 --> 01:31:27,340
Your dreams will fall into the water.

967
01:31:28,520 --> 01:31:30,520
And you will be drowned in that water.

968
01:31:33,200 --> 01:31:34,900
With what force will you fight?

969
01:31:37,180 --> 01:31:44,850
With the same force with which
I bound Geyhatu and drove him from my land

970
01:31:47,560 --> 01:31:49,920
I buried the enemies...

971
01:31:50,230 --> 01:31:52,740
...enemies that you are afraid to mention.

972
01:31:54,650 --> 01:31:57,720
When I was fighting the
Mongols and the Byzantines...

973
01:31:58,480 --> 01:32:00,190
None of you were here.

974
01:32:01,120 --> 01:32:03,930
So don't make any decisions on my land.

975
01:32:04,890 --> 01:32:11,010
You wouldn't even be able to if
you didn't know Mother Sultan.

976
01:32:12,720 --> 01:32:13,790
Otherwise...

977
01:32:15,810 --> 01:32:17,450
You will be crushed.

978
01:32:21,380 --> 01:32:23,070
- Osman Bey!
- Enough!

979
01:32:28,090 --> 01:32:30,190
This is all of our issue.

980
01:32:31,810 --> 01:32:33,340
Hide your anger for the enemy.

981
01:32:34,320 --> 01:32:36,880
We shall, Mother Sultan, we shall.

982
01:32:37,630 --> 01:32:38,940
However...

983
01:32:39,810 --> 01:32:42,950
Instead of making
an effort to achieve an agreement...

984
01:32:43,320 --> 01:32:45,510
...Osman Bey is trying to fight us!

985
01:32:47,580 --> 01:32:48,760
Candar Bey.

986
01:32:49,950 --> 01:32:51,590
Protecting homeland is a war.

987
01:32:56,710 --> 01:33:01,460
But if you want us to convince you...

988
01:33:01,950 --> 01:33:03,920
You have to ask yourself sincerely first.

989
01:33:06,040 --> 01:33:09,710
Otherwise, we'll start thinking you do not
care about the cause.

990
01:33:10,510 --> 01:33:11,960
You must be Turgut Bey.

991
01:33:13,770 --> 01:33:15,760
You are the shadow of Osman Bey.

992
01:33:16,970 --> 01:33:21,030
We are the shadow of good,
but I see you have become evil itself.

993
01:33:28,490 --> 01:33:30,920
Dear Mother Sultan, I beg your pardon

994
01:33:32,070 --> 01:33:34,200
We didn't come here to hear insults.

995
01:33:35,090 --> 01:33:37,830
It's a difficult issue, but...

996
01:33:40,400 --> 01:33:42,140
I don't trust these Beys.

997
01:33:42,710 --> 01:33:44,660
- Excuse me
- Candar Bey!

998
01:33:45,960 --> 01:33:47,700
Unless I say the meeting is over...

999
01:33:47,970 --> 01:33:50,450
No one dares to take a single step!

1000
01:33:58,480 --> 01:33:59,920
I'm waiting for you to be seated.

1001
01:34:15,970 --> 01:34:19,030
The messenger is waiting for a decision from us.

1002
01:34:20,270 --> 01:34:22,430
If we are going to fight,
then the decision to go to war

1003
01:34:23,980 --> 01:34:27,360
And if we are going to
increase taxes and pay blood money

1004
01:34:28,200 --> 01:34:29,590
We will send this decision.

1005
01:34:36,660 --> 01:34:37,890
And now...

1006
01:34:43,770 --> 01:34:45,550
The messenger of the Mongols has come,
Mother Sultan.

1007
01:34:52,650 --> 01:34:53,690
Let him.

1008
01:35:24,330 --> 01:35:27,850
Commander Naiman wants you to pay
blood money for Samagar.

1009
01:35:27,950 --> 01:35:31,850
And he commands to raise taxes to three times more
because of your disobedience.

1010
01:35:33,840 --> 01:35:36,590
And he wants Osman's head, too.

1011
01:35:52,930 --> 01:35:55,650
Olof, I have gathered
a huge army against the Muslims

1012
01:35:57,240 --> 01:35:59,210
You are the one who will lead this army.

1013
01:36:01,540 --> 01:36:05,480
You are going to serve the cross you wear
on your neck, even if it is at the cost of your life.

1014
01:36:06,230 --> 01:36:10,580
I will continue to serve Holy Jesus
until my last breath

1015
01:36:12,650 --> 01:36:14,020
With this army...

1016
01:36:14,960 --> 01:36:20,930
I will spill rivers of blood of those
who want to extinguish the light of Holy Jesus.

1017
01:36:23,510 --> 01:36:25,220
And this will not be very difficult.

1018
01:36:26,280 --> 01:36:30,580
Ismihan shattered their unity

1019
01:36:31,540 --> 01:36:36,480
And now they are uniting
to face the threat of the Mongols

1020
01:36:36,880 --> 01:36:38,770
And you will stand with Ismihan.

1021
01:36:40,580 --> 01:36:42,580
You run your job secretly.

1022
01:36:43,440 --> 01:36:47,870
Until they realise the army of Holy Jesus
in their lands.

1023
01:36:49,040 --> 01:36:53,590
Then our unity will end them.

1024
01:36:56,110 --> 01:36:59,540
We will no longer wait for our
enemies behind walls.

1025
01:37:00,190 --> 01:37:02,390
We will kill them in the fields.

1026
01:37:03,510 --> 01:37:05,310
Listen to me well now, Olof.

1027
01:37:12,370 --> 01:37:13,440
I could not hear.

1028
01:37:16,140 --> 01:37:17,140
Say it again.

1029
01:37:17,820 --> 01:37:21,780
I knew the Beys were fools,
but now I know they are also deaf.

1030
01:37:24,880 --> 01:37:28,930
Naiman wants blood money for Samagar
and taxes for your disobedience

1031
01:37:30,250 --> 01:37:32,440
In addition to your helpless head.

1032
01:37:41,300 --> 01:37:45,760
If I give him my head,
will he leave my country alone?

1033
01:37:46,250 --> 01:37:50,900
No, he'll keep taking
the taxes and blood money.

1034
01:37:51,620 --> 01:37:54,370
If you object, he will turn your lands into hell

1035
01:37:55,560 --> 01:37:57,480
We will take your head anyway, Osman.

1036
01:37:58,820 --> 01:38:00,400
He wants my head, did I hear right?

1037
01:38:05,660 --> 01:38:07,370
Now that he wants my head.

1038
01:38:17,040 --> 01:38:18,640
I will give you neither my head.

1039
01:38:20,350 --> 01:38:22,810
Nor the taxes that you want unjustly.

1040
01:38:25,360 --> 01:38:27,190
The only thing I will give you.

1041
01:38:37,980 --> 01:38:39,560
is death.

1042
01:38:48,560 --> 01:38:49,950
And now...

1043
01:39:01,710 --> 01:39:04,090
Take this to Commander Neiman.

1044
01:39:05,120 --> 01:39:07,370
If he wants to end up like this...

1045
01:39:08,820 --> 01:39:11,680
Tell him that Osman Bey
is waiting for him in his homeland.

1046
01:39:12,350 --> 01:39:13,490
Go.

1047
01:39:13,610 --> 01:39:16,920
Osman Bey, what have you done?

1048
01:39:20,210 --> 01:39:21,700
I have made my opinion clear.

1049
01:39:23,310 --> 01:39:24,480
We will fight.

1050
01:39:27,110 --> 01:39:28,420
Did you ask us?

1051
01:39:30,180 --> 01:39:32,610
Will you involve me in the war
without asking me?

1052
01:39:40,680 --> 01:39:42,890
Don't trust your abundant gold.

1053
01:39:44,980 --> 01:39:47,270
And do not brag that you have many alps.

1054
01:39:48,770 --> 01:39:52,690
You are many, but we are equal to you.

1055
01:39:55,720 --> 01:39:59,800
If you have a brave heart,
you will fight with us.

1056
01:40:01,680 --> 01:40:05,110
But if you are not brave..

1057
01:40:05,410 --> 01:40:08,620
We are brave, and we have alps.

1058
01:40:09,100 --> 01:40:16,340
But you want to push us to
a war in which we will be erased!

1059
01:40:16,620 --> 01:40:20,240
Neyman's armies are huge.

1060
01:40:23,570 --> 01:40:25,730
Those who were warned,

1061
01:40:26,030 --> 01:40:36,910
“Your enemies have mobilized their
q forces against you, so fear them,”

1062
01:40:38,760 --> 01:40:41,820
the warning only made them grow stronger in faith...

1063
01:40:42,890 --> 01:40:48,920
and they replied, “Allah ˹alone˺ is sufficient ˹as an aid˺
for us and ˹He˺ is the best Protector.”

1064
01:40:50,165 --> 01:40:52,805
[Surah Ali Imran - 173]

1065
01:40:56,870 --> 01:40:58,190
Right now...

1066
01:40:59,660 --> 01:41:02,140
I await your decisions.

1067
01:41:02,600 --> 01:41:09,560
We will all see together if you
are true warriors and believers.

1068
01:41:23,330 --> 01:41:25,220
Do you think she'll come?

1069
01:41:27,790 --> 01:41:29,580
No?

1070
01:41:32,090 --> 01:41:35,120
I offended her greatly.

1071
01:41:38,750 --> 01:41:42,800
She won't come.

1072
01:41:51,000 --> 01:41:53,140
Alcicek.

1073
01:42:06,740 --> 01:42:08,230
Look.

1074
01:42:09,070 --> 01:42:10,830
Do you see?

1075
01:42:11,880 --> 01:42:13,890
I said she would come.

1076
01:42:17,510 --> 01:42:21,110
Are you telling me I am a fool?

1077
01:42:21,600 --> 01:42:23,680
You're right.

1078
01:42:24,110 --> 01:42:27,200
If it had been the old Alcicek,
she would not have come.

1079
01:42:27,980 --> 01:42:30,310
But this is the new Alcicek.

1080
01:42:31,310 --> 01:42:33,420
She is stupid.

1081
01:42:36,500 --> 01:42:39,180
She hears the sound of her heart.

1082
01:42:39,450 --> 01:42:42,210
She can't stop herself.

1083
01:42:46,570 --> 01:42:48,160
No.

1084
01:42:50,430 --> 01:42:52,730
She is talking about me.

1085
01:42:54,090 --> 01:42:56,820
I'm the fool.

1086
01:42:59,470 --> 01:43:02,090
I didn't listen to my heart.

1087
01:43:05,930 --> 01:43:08,610
I am the one who hurt his lover.

1088
01:43:11,240 --> 01:43:14,350
I'm the one who left her
in the middle of the road.

1089
01:43:25,650 --> 01:43:27,440
Though...

1090
01:43:28,880 --> 01:43:31,660
I have come to my senses now.

1091
01:43:33,010 --> 01:43:35,260
Tell me.

1092
01:43:36,670 --> 01:43:39,480
Is it too late to regret?

1093
01:43:42,000 --> 01:43:49,190
Can you forgive this man who did not allow
the tears to dry in those beautiful eyes?

1094
01:43:49,920 --> 01:43:53,360
How do I trust the man who
left me in the middle of the road?

1095
01:43:53,550 --> 01:43:55,770
What if he does the same thing again?

1096
01:43:56,120 --> 01:43:57,790
No.

1097
01:43:58,420 --> 01:44:00,170
I will not.

1098
01:44:00,800 --> 01:44:02,180
I can't.

1099
01:44:02,830 --> 01:44:05,150
Trust me.

1100
01:44:05,580 --> 01:44:09,750
How can I trust your words?

1101
01:44:14,650 --> 01:44:20,960
I swear on this tree, birds and the soil...

1102
01:44:21,460 --> 01:44:24,020
I swear on my beloved.

1103
01:44:25,440 --> 01:44:30,040
That I will never leave you again,
Alcicek.

1104
01:44:30,850 --> 01:44:33,180
Tell me.

1105
01:44:34,100 --> 01:44:36,670
Can you forgive me?

1106
01:44:51,060 --> 01:44:53,060
I forgive you.

1107
01:44:56,930 --> 01:44:58,900
But this was your last chance.

1108
01:44:59,310 --> 01:45:01,200
Last chance.

1109
01:45:14,920 --> 01:45:18,360
Sogut.

1110
01:45:18,380 --> 01:45:20,440
Osman.

1111
01:45:21,300 --> 01:45:24,120
I knew he would declare war.

1112
01:45:24,330 --> 01:45:26,610
But what he did...

1113
01:45:29,530 --> 01:45:38,200
When Neiman comes, Osman will regret
refusing my help.

1114
01:45:40,670 --> 01:45:49,030
Osman Bey thinks that the Beys will follow him
after this show of his!

1115
01:45:49,470 --> 01:45:58,180
He thinks that Beys respect him
and that he has satisfied them.

1116
01:45:59,070 --> 01:46:05,070
You will write a letter to each Bey, Avci.

1117
01:46:05,320 --> 01:46:13,460
You will send them,
and no one will ally with Osman.

1118
01:46:13,870 --> 01:46:16,270
As you order, my Sultan.

1119
01:46:22,790 --> 01:46:25,280
Osman Bey.

1120
01:46:26,010 --> 01:46:29,660
In this way he went out
to establish a state...

1121
01:46:30,860 --> 01:46:33,260
...he'll be history.

1122
01:46:38,100 --> 01:46:42,080
I know we have a lot of problems, my Bey.

1123
01:46:42,080 --> 01:46:44,080
Ismihan on one side.

1124
01:46:44,410 --> 01:46:49,200
- The Mongols on the other side,but...
- We certainly have a lot of problems.

1125
01:46:51,710 --> 01:46:55,010
We want to do a good job, my Bey.

1126
01:46:58,070 --> 01:47:01,480
I know very well what you're going to say.

1127
01:47:05,400 --> 01:47:09,110
Do you think Aktemur agrees?

1128
01:47:09,320 --> 01:47:12,460
Actimor agrees, my Bey.

1129
01:47:14,570 --> 01:47:18,220
If you would agree too...

1130
01:47:20,600 --> 01:47:22,900
Can I come in, my Bey?

1131
01:47:26,830 --> 01:47:29,210
Come on, Aktemur.

1132
01:47:38,620 --> 01:47:42,810
Germiyan and Karesi tribes
ceased trading with us.

1133
01:47:45,460 --> 01:47:48,170
And Cobanogullari put a limit on the trade.

1134
01:47:51,960 --> 01:47:58,370
We don't have relationships only with them,
so we'll overcome their absence.

1135
01:48:04,940 --> 01:48:06,920
Aktemur.

1136
01:48:09,300 --> 01:48:11,140
Come here.

1137
01:48:12,540 --> 01:48:15,550
Let's talk, man to man.

1138
01:48:27,880 --> 01:48:30,700
The caravanserai near Kobrohisar

1139
01:48:44,060 --> 01:48:46,170
Whatever!

1140
01:48:46,470 --> 01:48:51,660
This is so boring!
I was going to be a spy!

1141
01:48:54,800 --> 01:48:57,040
It was a mistake to partner up with you.

1142
01:48:57,320 --> 01:49:00,370
I told Bala Hatun that
I needed to do this on my own.

1143
01:49:00,530 --> 01:49:03,700
That Cerkutay would encumber me!

1144
01:49:08,060 --> 01:49:13,110
Yes, if you weren't be with me,
who would you be with?

1145
01:49:14,520 --> 01:49:17,980
Everyone but you.

1146
01:49:18,250 --> 01:49:25,260
But they insisted a lot and said Jerkotay
must come.

1147
01:49:40,030 --> 01:49:41,790
I found it.

1148
01:49:42,220 --> 01:49:46,040
- What did you find?
- I found it, I found it.

1149
01:49:51,110 --> 01:49:52,670
I swear I found it

1150
01:49:53,820 --> 01:49:56,200
Tell me what did you find, man?

1151
01:49:57,470 --> 01:50:00,390
I found what I was looking for.

1152
01:50:11,530 --> 01:50:14,050
Tell me, Aktemur.

1153
01:50:15,000 --> 01:50:18,080
Are you sure of your love this time?

1154
01:50:20,570 --> 01:50:23,710
Know that I won't forgive you one more time.

1155
01:50:25,600 --> 01:50:26,960
Uncle.

1156
01:50:29,550 --> 01:50:31,960
I was always sure of my love.

1157
01:50:32,530 --> 01:50:36,210
But my anger blinded my eyes.

1158
01:50:37,180 --> 01:50:40,970
I broke Alcicek's heart.
I made a mistake.

1159
01:50:45,760 --> 01:50:47,430
Son.

1160
01:50:49,760 --> 01:50:52,680
You will fight for your love.

1161
01:50:53,470 --> 01:50:56,120
You will follow her.

1162
01:50:56,980 --> 01:51:00,720
You shouldn't collapse in a tiny damage.

1163
01:51:04,670 --> 01:51:11,290
Love does not forgive mistakes.

1164
01:51:13,050 --> 01:51:15,380
There will be no mistake anymore uncle.

1165
01:51:16,260 --> 01:51:20,020
From now on it's time to heal
the heart I've broken

1166
01:51:21,220 --> 01:51:23,110
I spoke with Alcicek,
made it up for her.

1167
01:51:26,670 --> 01:51:27,700
Eyvallah.

1168
01:51:29,210 --> 01:51:31,850
Then I'll do what I need to do.

1169
01:51:36,680 --> 01:51:38,560
But there is something else.

1170
01:51:45,240 --> 01:51:46,210
Oktem Bey.

1171
01:51:47,950 --> 01:51:49,730
He is with Ismihan.

1172
01:51:50,860 --> 01:51:53,410
We will become relatives in this marriage.

1173
01:51:57,110 --> 01:52:00,100
Uncle, if you don't want to...

1174
01:52:00,100 --> 01:52:05,710
No, don't worry, I'll do what I have to do.

1175
01:52:22,190 --> 01:52:25,020
The smell of blood coming from Ingol...

1176
01:52:25,710 --> 01:52:28,990
...will cause a burning sensation
in the farthest part of Osman's nose

1177
01:52:28,990 --> 01:52:36,300
We will avenge everything we have lost so far,
not just what we lost in Ingöl

1178
01:52:36,300 --> 01:52:38,700
Finally, my love.

1179
01:52:39,940 --> 01:52:42,000
It will make amends for us, my love

1180
01:52:43,260 --> 01:52:46,420
We are now stronger than ever.

1181
01:52:55,030 --> 01:52:58,350
Here comes our only friend among them.

1182
01:53:07,120 --> 01:53:09,700
Come, Bayindir, come, my old friend.

1183
01:53:18,880 --> 01:53:21,750
This is a sign of our friendship.

1184
01:53:25,670 --> 01:53:32,390
We are enemies in front of the eyes
and friends in the absence of eyes.

1185
01:53:35,910 --> 01:53:40,790
I will give you whatever you ask for Inegol.

1186
01:53:42,190 --> 01:53:43,660
Inegol.

1187
01:53:43,840 --> 01:53:49,990
But that will remain between the two of us.

1188
01:53:56,740 --> 01:54:01,110
I see, Bayindir, I see.

1189
01:54:01,800 --> 01:54:08,760
Considering you even share your gold,
what you say must be true.

1190
01:54:10,100 --> 01:54:13,900
So, Ismihan lost your friendship, too.

1191
01:54:13,900 --> 01:54:15,320
Yes.

1192
01:54:16,200 --> 01:54:21,550
Let them think Bayindir is a fool.

1193
01:54:22,480 --> 01:54:26,110
I will kill them all with you.

1194
01:54:27,200 --> 01:54:31,320
We'll both be good partners, Olof.

1195
01:54:31,760 --> 01:54:33,900
We will be good partners.

1196
01:54:35,360 --> 01:54:37,750
We were already good, Bayindir.

1197
01:54:38,780 --> 01:54:41,820
We were good until Ismihan.

1198
01:54:41,820 --> 01:54:47,840
Then she possessed both of us.

1199
01:54:53,740 --> 01:54:55,120
Alcicek.

1200
01:54:56,800 --> 01:54:59,520
Osman will go to ask Alcicek for marriage.

1201
01:54:59,760 --> 01:55:04,340
Is this Alcicek the girl you couldn't marry?

1202
01:55:05,110 --> 01:55:07,020
Stop there, Hatun.

1203
01:55:07,740 --> 01:55:10,120
The bride has not yet mounted the horse.

1204
01:55:10,460 --> 01:55:13,980
Only Allah knows what will happen in the end

1205
01:55:15,590 --> 01:55:17,480
Who will attend the ceremony?

1206
01:55:17,480 --> 01:55:21,510
Everyone will be there from Ismihan to Turgut.

1207
01:55:21,510 --> 01:55:25,400
They will certainly take measures, however...

1208
01:55:25,400 --> 01:55:28,950
The headless herd quickly disperses.

1209
01:55:29,700 --> 01:55:33,110
Well, take advantage of this opportunity, Olof.

1210
01:55:43,310 --> 01:55:45,280
I will take Inegol.

1211
01:55:54,400 --> 01:55:56,000
This doesn't fit me!

1212
01:55:56,000 --> 01:56:00,240
I look terrible!
You are such a joke, Cerkutay!

1213
01:56:01,000 --> 01:56:05,470
It suits you, you look very beautiful.

1214
01:56:10,670 --> 01:56:13,880
Come on, walk, walk, you're too slow.

1215
01:56:13,880 --> 01:56:15,340
Hurry up, come on.

1216
01:56:15,880 --> 01:56:18,240
A beautiful word does not come
out of your mouth!

1217
01:56:21,000 --> 01:56:22,910
I'm tired of walking!

1218
01:56:22,910 --> 01:56:26,220
Why did we leave those horses
behind and go on foot?

1219
01:56:26,710 --> 01:56:27,980
Let's go.

1220
01:56:28,900 --> 01:56:31,080
That jaw only works for eating.

1221
01:56:31,080 --> 01:56:33,470
Hey, I ask you where we are going!

1222
01:56:53,110 --> 01:56:54,960
What are you looking at?

1223
01:57:02,990 --> 01:57:05,020
Are you seeing my face for the first time?

1224
01:57:07,390 --> 01:57:09,210
It is not going to work like that.

1225
01:57:10,380 --> 01:57:13,310
You look very beautiful and very clean.

1226
01:57:24,620 --> 01:57:26,960
Close your eyes, close, close.

1227
01:57:27,480 --> 01:57:31,440
You are out of your mind!
What are you doing, you crazy!?

1228
01:57:35,110 --> 01:57:38,990
You're absolutely insane.
You had a brain that big, and it's gone too!

1229
01:57:40,350 --> 01:57:44,400
Come on, come on, here, here!

1230
01:58:07,870 --> 01:58:12,030
Stop! Stop!

1231
01:58:15,240 --> 01:58:16,360
What do you want?

1232
01:58:20,000 --> 01:58:21,400
Stop!

1233
01:58:22,880 --> 01:58:25,580
They raided our inn.

1234
01:58:25,840 --> 01:58:28,860
My sister and I, we...
Sister!

1235
01:58:32,500 --> 01:58:37,140
We could hardly run away with our lives.

1236
01:58:38,800 --> 01:58:44,350
Yes, yes, I am his sister!
Forever sister!

1237
01:58:46,880 --> 01:58:50,600
Help us, help us!

1238
01:58:50,600 --> 01:58:55,860
Take us with you at least to Kupruhisar.

1239
01:59:17,440 --> 01:59:20,340
Mongols want to finish the job.

1240
01:59:21,040 --> 01:59:26,860
For that reason we will not leave our tribes
and all our possessions without measures.

1241
01:59:28,550 --> 01:59:30,320
We will always be ready.

1242
01:59:32,800 --> 01:59:35,700
Mongols will attack us soon as you killed
their messenger.

1243
01:59:36,240 --> 01:59:40,520
So what about the wedding, Osman Bey?

1244
01:59:49,110 --> 01:59:52,080
Oktem cannot make any move
without their knowledge.

1245
01:59:54,910 --> 01:59:57,280
Obviously, the wedding is part of the game.

1246
01:59:58,350 --> 01:59:59,740
Once we know the game...

1247
02:00:02,570 --> 02:00:04,700
We will be victorious.

1248
02:00:07,660 --> 02:00:08,740
My Bey.

1249
02:00:11,060 --> 02:00:16,400
If they set up a game, taking advantage
of my love, I'll kill them all.

1250
02:00:17,160 --> 02:00:20,000
We'll settle the accounts.

1251
02:00:20,740 --> 02:00:22,260
Don't worry.

1252
02:00:27,700 --> 02:00:31,340
Are the preparations done?

1253
02:00:33,840 --> 02:00:35,800
We are always ready, my Bey.

1254
02:00:40,060 --> 02:00:43,900
We don't take any breath
without our swords, my Bey.

1255
02:00:45,750 --> 02:00:47,480
Let's go and take Alcicek.

1256
02:00:47,480 --> 02:00:50,750
And if they play a game,
we will take their lives then.

1257
02:00:51,320 --> 02:00:52,840
Praise be.

1258
02:00:52,840 --> 02:00:56,640
The alps and sisters
who will bring gifts are also armed, my Bey.

1259
02:00:56,640 --> 02:00:58,000
Don't worry.

1260
02:00:58,000 --> 02:01:01,990
Praise be upon you, Hatuns.

1261
02:01:01,990 --> 02:01:05,460
Come on then alps, hatuns!

1262
02:01:07,520 --> 02:01:10,510
- Come on!
- Come on, come on!

1263
02:01:58,790 --> 02:02:01,290
Welcome, Mother Sultan.

1264
02:02:06,980 --> 02:02:09,160
Thank you Oktem Bey.

1265
02:02:24,420 --> 02:02:25,680
Brothers!

1266
02:02:27,850 --> 02:02:32,710
We have taken all our might
into the enemy's homeland!

1267
02:02:34,810 --> 02:02:39,880
Now is the time for us to cling
tightly to our own country

1268
02:02:41,850 --> 02:02:44,880
We will make Inegol our home!

1269
02:02:45,570 --> 02:02:47,690
Our brothers died.

1270
02:02:48,530 --> 02:02:52,290
If we die, we die for our land!

1271
02:02:52,790 --> 02:02:58,910
But first we will kill everyone in Inegol!

1272
02:03:00,380 --> 02:03:06,150
And we will give it as a gift
to our brothers who will come from the north!

1273
02:03:06,940 --> 02:03:14,080
We will give them a homeland,
and we will also give them the light of Jesus!

1274
02:03:16,450 --> 02:03:20,120
- Are you with me, my brothers?
- We're with you, Olof

1275
02:03:20,450 --> 02:03:24,220
- Are you with me, my brothers?
- We're with you, Olof

1276
02:03:26,530 --> 02:03:28,570
Let Jesus enlighten our way

1277
02:03:37,240 --> 02:03:40,930
Come on, come on, Dan

1278
02:03:45,990 --> 02:03:48,310
- Did you start the fires?
- Yes.

1279
02:03:48,930 --> 02:03:52,850
I have set fires in all the villages around Inegol,
as you have requested

1280
02:03:53,330 --> 02:03:54,870
Lovely.

1281
02:03:55,650 --> 02:04:00,890
Soon the Ingol alps
will go out to put out these fires.

1282
02:04:01,940 --> 02:04:07,550
We'll run in when the door opens.

1283
02:04:08,260 --> 02:04:12,260
- Are you with me, my brothers?
- We're with you, Olof

1284
02:04:31,610 --> 02:04:33,050
My Alcicek.

1285
02:04:35,400 --> 02:04:38,200
You finally managed it, huh?

1286
02:04:39,970 --> 02:04:43,390
I didn't do anything mother,
it's thanks to you.

1287
02:04:46,900 --> 02:04:51,620
But I didn't understand,
how did you change your mind?

1288
02:04:54,350 --> 02:04:56,690
Are you satisfied with my marriage?

1289
02:04:58,580 --> 02:05:00,830
My mind is not satisfied.

1290
02:05:03,070 --> 02:05:08,250
But if you ask me about my heart,
it is satisfied, my daughter.

1291
02:05:13,200 --> 02:05:16,480
If you are wondering when I changed my mind...

1292
02:05:18,760 --> 02:05:23,290
It changed that day you put the dagger
on your neck, Alcicek.

1293
02:05:25,650 --> 02:05:28,820
Since that day I have not rested
my head on the pillow peacefully.

1294
02:05:28,840 --> 02:05:31,390
I can't breathe since that day.

1295
02:05:40,710 --> 02:05:42,110
Mother.

1296
02:05:45,770 --> 02:05:47,480
My daughter.

1297
02:05:48,900 --> 02:05:50,380
My Cicek (flower in Turkish)

1298
02:05:53,690 --> 02:05:55,480
I still can't believe it.

1299
02:05:59,500 --> 02:06:01,610
It's like I'm in a dream.

1300
02:06:04,180 --> 02:06:06,100
You are not in a dream, my daughter.

1301
02:06:12,320 --> 02:06:15,990
May Allah open your path and luck for you, my daughter

1302
02:06:19,360 --> 02:06:23,080
Come on, go now and help with the preparations.

1303
02:06:23,770 --> 02:06:24,750
Come on.

1304
02:06:25,160 --> 02:06:27,330
Osman Bey must be soon to come.

1305
02:06:42,300 --> 02:06:44,360
I am satisfied just for now, duaghter.

1306
02:06:45,490 --> 02:06:47,200
Just for now.

1307
02:06:57,400 --> 02:06:58,500
- Boran
- My Bey!

1308
02:06:58,550 --> 02:07:02,970
Let the alps be well positioned in the outskirts
We don't know what Ismihan can do, be careful.

1309
02:07:03,060 --> 02:07:04,090
Yes my Bey.

1310
02:07:41,550 --> 02:07:45,230
- Peace be upon you.
- And peace be upon you too.

1311
02:07:48,510 --> 02:07:53,030
We have finally met together
for a good deed, Osman Bey.

1312
02:07:53,310 --> 02:07:57,590
Both good deeds and bad deeds
come from Allah, Mother Sultan.

1313
02:08:01,110 --> 02:08:08,120
This is the first time you come to Marmaracik
not chained up after the trial and the Kantakouzanos matter.

1314
02:08:10,640 --> 02:08:12,310
This is nice too.

1315
02:08:17,070 --> 02:08:18,980
It is true.

1316
02:08:20,090 --> 02:08:25,210
But when I came to Marmaragic,
my sword was in my hand

1317
02:08:26,160 --> 02:08:28,770
And it was covered in blood

1318
02:08:30,740 --> 02:08:34,980
This Marmaracik was given to
Oktem Bey by me.

1319
02:08:37,340 --> 02:08:41,310
If you want me to come like I did previously,
I can.

1320
02:08:42,630 --> 02:08:46,260
No, that's fine.

1321
02:08:49,700 --> 02:08:55,170
It is known that we no longer raise our swords against
each other, but rather against the enemy

1322
02:08:55,610 --> 02:08:58,680
Let this good deed be a sign of this.

1323
02:08:59,690 --> 02:09:03,230
Let us take the girl first,
let us perform our wedding.

1324
02:09:03,990 --> 02:09:09,150
And then we'll talk about
who will raise his sword against whom.

1325
02:09:10,090 --> 02:09:12,520
But I did not say that I would unite with you.

1326
02:09:14,060 --> 02:09:18,610
That will happen too, Osman Bey.

1327
02:09:19,890 --> 02:09:26,310
You are mature enough to forget bad
experiences for the sake of your future.

1328
02:09:28,610 --> 02:09:30,760
Let us finish this first.

1329
02:09:33,940 --> 02:09:35,880
Let's sit.

1330
02:09:38,950 --> 02:09:41,820
Ingol Castle

1331
02:09:42,850 --> 02:09:46,260
Hurry up, alps we need to
put out the fires before they get worse!

1332
02:09:52,160 --> 02:09:54,260
Stop! Open the gates.

1333
02:10:08,020 --> 02:10:10,580
Who are you? And what do you want?

1334
02:10:51,670 --> 02:10:54,490
Protect yourselves with shields!

1335
02:11:21,480 --> 02:11:22,560
Open!

1336
02:11:28,550 --> 02:11:29,510
Open!

1337
02:11:41,010 --> 02:11:43,660
Olof, shields are burning.

1338
02:11:45,540 --> 02:11:46,630
Open!

1339
02:11:48,720 --> 02:11:49,630
Close!

1340
02:11:55,150 --> 02:11:56,830
Attack!

1341
02:12:43,000 --> 02:12:47,340
By Allah's command and on
the Sunnah of the Messenger of God

1342
02:12:47,860 --> 02:12:53,870
I ask the hand of our daughter Alcicek
for my nephew Aktimur, who is like a son to me.

1343
02:12:55,230 --> 02:12:59,130
But I would first like to hear
Alcicek's response.

1344
02:13:03,730 --> 02:13:09,360
Let Mother Sultan and her father talk later.

1345
02:13:14,020 --> 02:13:19,040
Tell us, Alcicek, do you love Aktemur?

1346
02:13:25,660 --> 02:13:27,330
I love him, my Bey.

1347
02:13:35,030 --> 02:13:36,250
Oktem Bey.

1348
02:13:37,090 --> 02:13:41,550
We know our son Aktemur.

1349
02:13:41,960 --> 02:13:46,080
We know Aktemur Bey.

1350
02:13:47,010 --> 02:13:48,710
And we know his courage.

1351
02:13:50,510 --> 02:13:54,060
So he is worthy of our daughter.

1352
02:13:58,710 --> 02:14:06,450
And I, as her father, give her to him.

1353
02:14:07,030 --> 02:14:08,440
Congratulations.

1354
02:14:12,970 --> 02:14:15,730
Let this open a good path.

1355
02:14:16,020 --> 02:14:17,910
Allah bless you.

1356
02:14:18,230 --> 02:14:20,380
May Allah give you children and honor.

1357
02:14:20,380 --> 02:14:21,450
Amen.

1358
02:14:22,580 --> 02:14:23,680
Amen.

1359
02:14:24,780 --> 02:14:25,930
Amen.

1360
02:14:27,340 --> 02:14:30,450
But there are things that
will not happen again.

1361
02:14:30,890 --> 02:14:39,010
If my daughter comes to my door crying...

1362
02:14:41,330 --> 02:14:43,710
Then I will make you pay for this.

1363
02:14:51,300 --> 02:14:53,910
If anyone is hurt again..

1364
02:14:54,780 --> 02:14:58,740
I will kill them myself.

1365
02:15:00,220 --> 02:15:02,240
Eyvallah, Osman Bey.

1366
02:15:02,630 --> 02:15:04,100
Rest assured.

1367
02:15:06,310 --> 02:15:07,830
For the good of all to happen.

1368
02:15:14,140 --> 02:15:15,480
Thank Allah.

1369
02:15:16,380 --> 02:15:19,030
We witnessed these two young people's
togetherness finally.

1370
02:15:31,180 --> 02:15:35,400
This won't fail us, right Bayindir Bey?

1371
02:15:38,060 --> 02:15:42,390
I'm afraid.
What if Ismihan Sultan hears?

1372
02:15:47,870 --> 02:15:49,350
Huseyin Efendi.

1373
02:15:50,620 --> 02:15:53,770
Do I take you with me to be afraid?

1374
02:15:55,450 --> 02:15:56,860
Do not be afraid.

1375
02:15:58,780 --> 02:16:03,980
No one will ever know we're
secretly working with Olof.

1376
02:16:05,550 --> 02:16:09,440
Until we get the strength.

1377
02:16:12,520 --> 02:16:18,320
Look, look, do you hear this, Huseyin?

1378
02:16:19,340 --> 02:16:22,280
There's nothing this can't solve.

1379
02:16:30,400 --> 02:16:33,519
They can even open the gates of Inegol.

1380
02:16:41,650 --> 02:16:43,620
Did you facilitate Olof's work?

1381
02:16:43,799 --> 02:16:45,280
We did, Bayindir Bey.

1382
02:16:45,400 --> 02:16:48,160
Inegol belongs to Olof now.

1383
02:16:49,389 --> 02:16:50,910
Good.

1384
02:16:57,730 --> 02:17:04,139
You've been waiting for your job
without doing any work this whole time

1385
02:17:05,059 --> 02:17:07,330
And now you came in handy.

1386
02:17:08,389 --> 02:17:10,580
You will be handy again.

1387
02:17:10,870 --> 02:17:12,629
This is the reward for your work.

1388
02:17:18,290 --> 02:17:20,000
Don't hesitate, come on.

1389
02:18:32,170 --> 02:18:35,170
Inegol will be your grave, Olof.

1390
02:18:35,730 --> 02:18:38,129
You won't even have a grave.

1391
02:18:39,179 --> 02:18:41,790
I will not stop until I kill you all.

1392
02:18:42,509 --> 02:18:44,400
Inegol is the beginning.

1393
02:18:45,179 --> 02:18:48,939
But you won't see that.

1394
02:18:49,570 --> 02:18:52,189
They won't even find your dead bodies.

1395
02:19:06,170 --> 02:19:08,889
Inegol belongs to us now, Olof!

1396
02:19:09,150 --> 02:19:12,859
This place is our first land!

1397
02:19:13,179 --> 02:19:15,420
We will attack the Muslims from here!

1398
02:19:16,540 --> 02:19:21,030
We will light the light of Jesus Christ
from Inegol!

1399
02:19:27,040 --> 02:19:28,700
Remove the flags!

1400
02:19:50,220 --> 02:19:51,160
Congrats.

1401
02:19:51,270 --> 02:19:52,680
Congrats.

1402
02:20:00,620 --> 02:20:02,030
Congratulations, son.

1403
02:20:02,650 --> 02:20:04,480
Congrats.

1404
02:20:09,050 --> 02:20:10,820
Congratulations

1405
02:20:27,420 --> 02:20:29,800
Mother Sultan, Osman Bey.

1406
02:20:31,000 --> 02:20:32,930
We lost Inegol.

1407
02:20:50,180 --> 02:20:51,860
Did we lose Inegol?

1408
02:20:53,710 --> 02:20:54,870
How?

1409
02:20:57,830 --> 02:20:58,930
Who?

1410
02:21:00,710 --> 02:21:03,250
Olof, Olof, my Bey.

1411
02:21:06,910 --> 02:21:10,170
Olof?
What are you saying?

1412
02:21:10,240 --> 02:21:11,460
Turgut Bey!

1413
02:21:11,890 --> 02:21:13,750
He is just a messenger.

1414
02:21:14,460 --> 02:21:21,250
But I will eliminate Olof and the emperor
from whom he received the order!

1415
02:21:22,750 --> 02:21:26,600
Mongols weakened us.

1416
02:21:29,270 --> 02:21:31,330
But not to this degree!

1417
02:21:31,640 --> 02:21:35,770
If necessary, I will fight my last war
under the walls of Constantinople!

1418
02:21:35,800 --> 02:21:39,370
But I will never let infidels
take over the land of Turks!

1419
02:21:48,800 --> 02:21:50,850
If you have anything to do with this

1420
02:21:53,160 --> 02:21:55,770
Find yourself a place to hide.

1421
02:21:56,760 --> 02:21:59,000
What are you saying Osman Bey?

1422
02:21:59,740 --> 02:22:02,830
If I were to conquer Inegol,
would I ask your permission?

1423
02:22:03,870 --> 02:22:07,700
Do you think I can't take it
with one order of mine?

1424
02:22:14,410 --> 02:22:16,620
I took these lands with my own blood.

1425
02:22:18,850 --> 02:22:22,170
If I lose them with a game
you're involved in...

1426
02:22:24,450 --> 02:22:27,850
Then I will water this land
with your blood.

1427
02:22:39,540 --> 02:22:50,220
Visit our website for more: turkision.com